		["{npc:7953} and {npc:7952}'s raptors are in {area:367} on the {zone:1411} coast. At 40 {npc:7953} teaches {skill:762} to Trolls for 100g (10% less at Honored with {faction:530}), and it comes with a raptor. Other races learn {skill:762}, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer."] = "{npc:7953}和{npc:7952}的迅猛龙在{zone:1411}海岸的{area:367}。40级时，{npc:7953}以100金教巨魔{skill:762}（在{faction:530}达到尊敬时便宜10%），并附赠一头迅猛龙。其他种族可在本种族的骑术训练师那里学习{skill:762}，并获得自己的第一只坐骑。",
		["{npc:7953}, riding trainer"] = "{npc:7953}，骑术训练师",
		["{spell:10861} for other races"] = "{spell:10861}（其他种族）",
		["Any Horde race can buy these raptors, but riding one also takes {spell:10861}, which only Trolls get with {skill:762}. {npc:7953} teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with {faction:530} (the Darkspear Trolls Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a raptor for this character."] = "任何部落种族都能购买这些迅猛龙，但骑乘还需要{spell:10861}，它只有巨魔能随{skill:762}一并获得。其他种族需在{faction:530}达到崇拜后由{npc:7953}传授（暗矛巨魔声望指南有详细方法）。在此之前，别给这个角色买迅猛龙。",
		["Pick a colour"] = "挑选颜色",
		["{npc:7952} sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "{npc:7952}出售其他颜色（Forever 客户端中每只20金）。想要哪只就买哪只；如果喜欢送你的那只，也可以不买。",
		["{item:8588}, 20g"] = "{item:8588}，20金",
		["{item:8591}, 20g"] = "{item:8591}，20金",
		["{item:8592}, 20g"] = "{item:8592}，20金",
} end)()
