		["{item:3356} (Alliance)"] = "{item:3356}（联盟）",
		["39 {item:3356} for {spell:3452}: {skill:182}: {item:3356} (skill 125) in {zone:1440} (18-30), {zone:1437} (20-30) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:3356} in {zone:1434} is marked."] = "39个{item:3356}，用于{spell:3452}：{skill:182}：{item:3356}（技能125）产自{zone:1440}（18-30）、{zone:1437}（20-30）和{zone:1434}（30-45）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1434}中{item:3356}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:3356} (Horde)"] = "{item:3356}（部落）",
		["39 {item:3356} for {spell:3452}: {skill:182}: {item:3356} (skill 125) in {zone:1413} (10-25), {zone:1440} (18-30) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:3356} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "39个{item:3356}，用于{spell:3452}：{skill:182}：{item:3356}（技能125）产自{zone:1413}（10-25）、{zone:1440}（18-30）和{zone:1434}（30-45）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{item:3356}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{object:2045} (Alliance)"] = "{object:2045}（联盟）",
		["39 {object:2045} for {spell:3452}: {skill:182}: {object:2045} (skill 85) in {zone:1437} (20-30), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1425} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {object:2045} in {zone:1434} is marked."] = "39个{object:2045}，用于{spell:3452}：{skill:182}：{object:2045}（技能85）产自{zone:1437}（20-30）、{zone:1434}（30-45）和{zone:1425}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1434}中{object:2045}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{object:2045} (Horde)"] = "{object:2045}（部落）",
		["39 {object:2045} for {spell:3452}: {skill:182}: {object:2045} (skill 85) in {zone:1413} (10-25), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1425} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {object:2045} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "39个{object:2045}，用于{spell:3452}：{skill:182}：{object:2045}（技能85）产自{zone:1413}（10-25）、{zone:1434}（30-45）和{zone:1425}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{object:2045}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{object:2046} (Alliance)"] = "{object:2046}（联盟）",
		["40 {object:2046} for {item:8951} (8 of them for 225-300: pick them all now): {skill:182}: {object:2046} (skill 170) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {object:2046} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "40个{object:2046}，用于{item:8951}（225-300需8个：现在全采了）：{skill:182}：{object:2046}（技能170）产自{zone:1417}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:2046}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{object:2046} (Horde)"] = "{object:2046}（部落）",
		["40 {object:2046} for {item:8951} (8 of them for 225-300: pick them all now): {skill:182}: {object:2046} (skill 170) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {object:2046} in {zone:1444} is marked."] = "40个{object:2046}，用于{item:8951}（225-300需8个：现在全采了）：{skill:182}：{object:2046}（技能170）产自{zone:1417}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1444}中{object:2046}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["Expert {skill:171}"] = "高级{skill:171}",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:171} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4160} ({zone:1457}) and {npc:7948} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:4611} ({zone:1458}) and {npc:1386} ({zone:1435}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 40 {object:1623}, 39 {item:3356}, 39 {object:2045} and 40 {object:2046} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:3452} (from 160) and {item:8951} (from 195), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:171} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:4160}（{zone:1457}）和{npc:7948}（{zone:1444}）；部落{npc:4611}（{zone:1458}）和{npc:1386}（{zone:1435}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。150-225大约花33银20铜的商人货物，外加40个{object:1623}、39个{item:3356}、39个{object:2045}和40个{object:2046}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{spell:3452}（160起）和{item:8951}（195起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
		["{spell:3176} to 160"] = "{spell:3176} 到160",
		["{spell:3176} is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 12 crafts to 160. Each takes 2 {item:2453}, 2 {item:2450} and 1 {item:3372}. Two {item:2453} and two {item:2450} a craft; {item:2453} grows in the 15-30 zones."] = "{spell:3176}在150时为黄色（150黄、170绿、190灰）：大约12次制作可到160。每次需要2个{item:2453}、2个{item:2450}和1个{item:3372}。每次两个{item:2453}和两个{item:2450}；{item:2453}生长在15-30地区。",
		["{skill:171} recipes at 160"] = "{skill:171} 160时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:3452} (from 160)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:3452}（160起）。",
		["{spell:3452} to 195"] = "{spell:3452} 到195",
		["{spell:3452} is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195. Each takes 1 {item:3820}, 1 {item:3356} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3820} grows under water along the coasts: bring a water breathing elixir or come up for air. {item:3356} grows in the 20-40 zones."] = "{spell:3452}在160时为橙色（180黄、200绿、220灰）：大约39次制作可到195。每次需要1个{item:3820}、1个{item:3356}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3820}生长在沿海水下：带上水下呼吸药剂，或者浮上来换气。{item:3356}生长在20-40地区。",
		["{skill:171} recipes at 195"] = "{skill:171} 195时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:11450} (from 195)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:11450}（195起）。",
		["{item:8951} to 225"] = "{item:8951}到225",
		["{item:8951} is orange at 195 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 32 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 {item:3355}, 1 {item:3821} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3355} and {item:3821} are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the {zone:1418}). {skill:171} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:8951}在195时为橙色（215黄、235绿、255灰）：大约32次制作可到225。每次需要1个{item:3355}、1个{item:3821}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3355}和{item:3821}是30-45地区的草药（荆棘谷、阿拉希、{zone:1418}）。{skill:171} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
		["{skill:171} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:171} 225-300：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 51 {item:3372} (20s 40c) and 86 {item:8925} (4g 30s); about 4g 50s 40c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, Eldraeith and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐整个阶段的用量：51个{item:3372}（20银40铜）和86个{item:8925}（4金30银）；合计约4金50银40铜。箭头会选择本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、艾达伊斯和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
		["{item:13478} teaches {item:13445} ({skill:171} 265) for 1g 30s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:5178} ({zone:1455}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:3348} ({zone:1454}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too."] = "{item:13478}教{item:13445}（{skill:171} 265），售价1金30银。出售者：联盟{npc:5178}（{zone:1455}），限量；部落{npc:3348}（{zone:1454}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；拍卖行也常有的卖。",
		["{item:8836} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8836}（联盟）",
		["43 {item:8836} for {item:9154}: {skill:182}: {item:8836} (skill 220) in {zone:1448} (48-55), {zone:1422} (51-58) and {zone:1423} (53-60); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8836} in {zone:1422} is marked."] = "43个{item:8836}，用于{item:9154}：{skill:182}：{item:8836}（技能220）产自{zone:1448}（48-55）、{zone:1422}（51-58）和{zone:1423}（53-60）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1422}中{item:8836}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:8836} (Horde)"] = "{item:8836}（部落）",
		["43 {item:8836} for {item:9154}: {skill:182}: {item:8836} (skill 220) in {zone:1448} (48-55), {zone:1422} (51-58) and {zone:1423} (53-60); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8836} in {zone:1448} is marked."] = "43个{item:8836}，用于{item:9154}：{skill:182}：{item:8836}（技能220）产自{zone:1448}（48-55）、{zone:1422}（51-58）和{zone:1423}（53-60）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1448}中{item:8836}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:8838} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8838}（联盟）",
		["43 {item:8838} for {item:13445}: {skill:182}: {item:8838} (skill 230) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8838} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "43个{item:8838}，用于{item:13445}：{skill:182}：{item:8838}（技能230）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1425}中{item:8838}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:8838} (Horde)"] = "{item:8838}（部落）",
		["43 {item:8838} for {item:13445}: {skill:182}: {item:8838} (skill 230) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8838} in {zone:1444} is marked."] = "43个{item:8838}，用于{item:13445}：{skill:182}：{item:8838}（技能230）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1444}中{item:8838}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:13422} (Alliance)"] = "{item:13422}（联盟）",
		["43 {item:13422} for {item:13445}: {skill:356}; or the Auction House. Fish {object:180712} here."] = "43个{item:13422}，用于{item:13445}：{skill:356}；或在拍卖行购买。在此钓{object:180712}。",
		["{item:13422} (Horde)"] = "{item:13422}（部落）",
		["Artisan {skill:171}"] = "专家级{skill:171}",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:171} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:7948} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:1386} ({zone:1435}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 1g 30s of recipes and 4g 50s 40c of vendor goods, plus 43 {item:8836}, 43 {item:8838} and 43 {item:13422} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:9154} (from 230) and {item:13423} (from 250), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费4金50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:171} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:7948}（{zone:1444}）；部落{npc:1386}（{zone:1435}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。225-300大约花1金30银的配方钱和4金50银40铜的商人货物，外加43个{item:8836}、43个{item:8838}和43个{item:13422}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{item:9154}（230起）和{item:13423}（250起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
		["{item:8951} to 230"] = "{item:8951}练到230",
		["{item:8951} is yellow at 225 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 8 crafts to 230. Each takes 1 {item:3355}, 1 {item:3821} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3355} and {item:3821} are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the {zone:1418})."] = "{item:8951}在225时为黄色（215黄、235绿、255灰）：大约8次制作可到230。每次需要1个{item:3355}、1个{item:3821}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3355}和{item:3821}是30-45地区的草药（荆棘谷、阿拉希、{zone:1418}）。",
		["{skill:171} recipes at 230"] = "230点的{skill:171}配方",
		["Still at the Artisan trainer: {spell:11460} (from 230)."] = "仍在大师级训练师处：{spell:11460}（230起）。",
		["{item:9154} to 265"] = "{item:9154} 到265",
		["{item:9154} is orange at 230 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 43 crafts to 265. Each takes 1 {item:8836} and 1 {item:8925}. {item:8836} grow in the Plaguelands and {zone:1448} ({skill:182} 220); Crystal Vials come from alchemy vendors."] = "{item:9154}在230时为橙色（245黄、265绿、285灰）：大约43次制作可到265。每次需要1个{item:8836}和1个{item:8925}。{item:8836}生长在瘟疫之地和{zone:1448}（{skill:182} 220）；水晶瓶来自炼金供应商。",
		["{skill:171} recipes at 265"] = "{skill:171} 265时的配方",
		["Still at the Artisan trainer: {spell:17551} (from 250)."] = "仍在大师级训练师处：{spell:17551}（250起）。",
		["{item:13445} to 300"] = "{item:13445}做到300",
		["{item:13445} is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 2 {item:13423}, 1 {item:8838} and 1 {item:8925}. Make the 86 {item:13423} (43 crafts) first. {item:13422} comes from the {item:13422} schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). {item:8838} grows in the 40-55 zones. {skill:171} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:13445}在265时为橙色（280黄、300绿、320灰）：大约43次制作可到300。每次需要2个{item:13423}、1个{item:8838}和1个{item:8925}。先做好那86个{item:13423}（43次制作）。{item:13422}来自40-55地区海岸的{item:13422}鱼群，或拍卖行（渔夫成组出售）。{item:8838}生长在40-55地区。{skill:171} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包中的配方",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/blacksmithing"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:164}"] = "学习{skill:164}",
		["Apprentice {skill:164} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:164} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} (any blacksmithing supplier) and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} come from the Copper Veins of every starting zone. 1-75 takes about 1s of recipes, plus 286 {item:2835} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:164}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:164}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。买一个{item:5956}（任何锻造供应商）并与{skill:186}配合：{item:2835}和{item:2770}来自每个新手区域的铜矿脉。1-75大约花1银的配方钱，外加286个{item:2835}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1429} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1429}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1426} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1426}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1439} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1439}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:2521} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:2521}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1411} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1411}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1412} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1412}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["286 {item:2835} for {spell:2660} and {spell:3320} (116 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1420} is marked."] = "286个{item:2835}，用于{spell:2660}和{spell:3320}（其中116个用于75-150：现在全部采集）：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1420}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{spell:2660} to 35"] = "{spell:2660} 到35",
		["{spell:2660} is orange at 1 (yellow 15, green 35, grey 55): about 42 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft, a point every craft to 15."] = "{spell:2660}在1时为橙色（15黄、35绿、55灰）：大约42次制作可到35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次一个{item:2835}，到15前每次一点。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 35"] = "{skill:164} 35时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:3320} (from 25, 1s). Also learn {spell:1230171} (1s): Forever's {skill:164} camp item, 1 {item:2835} and 1 {item:2840}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:164} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a blacksmithing trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:3320}（25起，1银）。同时学习{spell:1230171}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:164}露营物品，需1个{item:2835}和1个{item:2840}，放在营火旁的营地以获得增益。“露营入门：{skill:164}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的锻造训练师那里。",
		["{spell:3320} to 75"] = "{spell:3320}练到75",
		["{spell:3320} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 64 crafts to 75. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320}在35时为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：大约64次制作可到75。每次需要2个{item:2835}。每次两个{item:2835}。磨石是后续图纸的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
		["Journeyman {skill:164}"] = "中级{skill:164}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:164} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:164} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:4258} ({zone:1455}), {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}), {npc:3136} ({zone:1431}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:10276} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:5511} ({zone:1453}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:4596} ({zone:1458}), {npc:2998} ({zone:1456}), {npc:3355} ({zone:1454}), Snarl ({zone:1454}) and Traugh ({zone:1413}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2666} (from 45, 2s) and {spell:3326} (from 50, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 19s 50c of recipes and 18c of vendor goods, plus 256 {item:2836}, 28 {item:2838}, 210 {item:2840} and 320 {item:2841} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银；它需要{skill:164} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:164}训练师都教：联盟{npc:4258}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:3136}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:10276}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:5511}（{zone:1453}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:4596}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:2998}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:3355}（{zone:1454}）、斯纳尔（{zone:1454}）和特劳格（{zone:1413}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:2666}（45起，2银）和{spell:3326}（50起，2银50铜）。75-150大约花19银50铜的配方钱和18铜的商人货物，外加256个{item:2836}、28个{item:2838}、210个{item:2840}和320个{item:2841}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:164} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 75-150：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5512}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:5817} and Sovik)."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：{item:5956}（工具：一个，放在包里，18铜）；总共约18铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5512}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:5817}和Sovik）。",
		["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "一件工具，放在包里",
		["256 {item:2836} for {spell:2672}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1436} is marked."] = "256个{item:2836}，用于{spell:2672}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1436}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["256 {item:2836} for {spell:2672}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1432} is marked."] = "256个{item:2836}，用于{spell:2672}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1432}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["256 {item:2836} for {spell:2672}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1439} is marked."] = "256个{item:2836}，用于{spell:2672}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1439}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["256 {item:2836} for {spell:2672}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "256个{item:2836}，用于{spell:2672}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["256 {item:2836} for {spell:2672}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1421} is marked."] = "256个{item:2836}，用于{spell:2672}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1421}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["28 {item:2838} for {spell:2674}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "28个{item:2838}，用于{spell:2674}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["28 {item:2838} for {spell:2674}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1440} is marked."] = "28个{item:2838}，用于{spell:2674}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1440}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["28 {item:2838} for {spell:2674}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "28个{item:2838}，用于{spell:2674}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{spell:3320} to 83"] = "{spell:3320}练到83",
		["{spell:3320} is green at 75 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 58 crafts to 83. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320}在75时为绿色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：大约58次制作可到83。每次需要2个{item:2835}。每次两个{item:2835}。磨石是后续图纸的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
		["{spell:2666} to 100"] = "{spell:2666}练到100",
		["{spell:2666} is orange at 83 (yellow 85, green 105, grey 125): about 21 crafts to 100. Each takes 10 {item:2840}. Forever teaches {spell:2666} from 45; it stays orange to 85. Ten Copper Bars a craft: smelt your {item:2770}. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (210 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:2666}在83时为橙色（85黄、105绿、125灰）：大约21次制作可到100。每次需要10个{item:2840}。Forever从45起就教{spell:2666}；它到85都保持橙色。每次十个铜锭：熔炼你的{item:2770}。附近需要铁砧。{item:5956}是工具：放在包里。{item:2840}（75-150需210个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 100"] = "100点的{skill:164}配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2674} (from 100, 10s)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:2674}（100起，10银）。",
		["{spell:2674} to 113"] = "{spell:2674} 到113",
		["{spell:2674} is yellow at 100 (yellow 100, green 107, grey 115): about 28 crafts to 113. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. {item:2838} comes from Iron Deposits; one a craft."] = "{spell:2674}在100时为黄色（100黄、107绿、115灰）：大约28次制作可到113。每次需要1个{item:2838}。{item:2838}来自铁矿脉；每次一个。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 113"] = "{skill:164} 113时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2672} (from 95, 5s)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:2672}（95起，5银）。",
		["{spell:2672} to 150"] = "{spell:2672}练到150",
		["{spell:2672} is orange at 113 (yellow 125, green 140, grey 155): about 64 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 {item:2841} and 2 {spell:3326}. Make the 128 {spell:3326} first. Each bracer takes two Coarse Grinding Stones ({item:2836} from Tin Veins): make them first; they give points too. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (320 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:2672}在113时为橙色（125黄、140绿、155灰）：大约64次制作可到150。每次需要5个{item:2841}和2个{spell:3326}。先做好那128个{spell:3326}。每个护腕要两块粗制磨石（{item:2836}来自锡矿脉）：先做好；它们也能涨点。附近需要铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150需320个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:164} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Expert {skill:164}"] = "高级{skill:164}",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4258} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}) and {npc:3355} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3501} (from 140) and {spell:3337} (from 100, 10s). 150-225 takes about 10s of recipes and 28s of vendor goods, plus 234 {item:2838}, 168 {item:3575}, 195 {item:3859}, 320 {item:3860} and 30 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:164} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:4258}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）和{npc:3355}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3501}（140起）和{spell:3337}（100起，10银）。150-225大约花10银的配方钱和28银的商人货物，外加234个{item:2838}、168个{item:3575}、195个{item:3859}、320个{item:3860}和30个{item:7912}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:164} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 150-225：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 {item:2605} (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817}). If you smelt the 195 {item:3859} yourself ({skill:186} 165: an {item:3575} and a Coal each), buy 195 Coal too (9g 75s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：28个{item:2605}（28银）；总共约28银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。如果你自己熔炼那195个{item:3859}（{skill:186} 165：每个需一个{item:3575}和一块煤），还要买195块煤（9金75银，杂货和锻造供应商）；若直接买锭则跳过。",
		["{item:2838} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2838}（联盟）",
		["234 {item:2838} for {item:6040}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1443} (30-40); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "234个{item:2838}，用于{item:6040}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1417}（30-40）、{zone:1434}（30-45）和{zone:1443}（30-40）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:2838} (Horde)"] = "{item:2838}（部落）",
		["234 {item:2838} for {item:6040}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1441} (25-35), {zone:1417} (30-40) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1441} is marked."] = "234个{item:2838}，用于{item:6040}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1441}（25-35）、{zone:1417}（30-40）和{zone:1434}（30-45）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1441}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:7912} (Alliance)"] = "{item:7912}（联盟）",
		["30 {item:7912} for {item:7964}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1434} (30-45), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1434} is marked."] = "30个{item:7912}，用于{item:7964}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1434}（30-45）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1434}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:7912} (Horde)"] = "{item:7912}（部落）",
		["30 {item:7912} for {item:7964}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "30个{item:7912}，用于{item:7964}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1443}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1443}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{spell:3501} to 175"] = "{spell:3501} 到175",
		["{spell:3501} is orange at 150 (yellow 165, green 177, grey 190): about 28 crafts to 175. Each takes 6 {item:3575} and 1 {item:2605}. Six Iron Bars and a {item:2605} a craft; {item:2605} comes from tailoring, leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. Orange to 165 on Forever, so a point every craft for the first fifteen. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3575} (168 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3501}在150时为橙色（165黄、177绿、190灰）：大约28次制作可到175。每次需要6个{item:3575}和1个{item:2605}。每次六个铁锭和一个{item:2605}；{item:2605}由裁缝、制皮和杂货供应商出售。在Forever中到165都是橙色，所以前十五次每次一点。附近需要铁砧。{item:3575}（150-225需168个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2772}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 175"] = "175点的{skill:164}配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9918} (from 175)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:9918}（175起）。",
		["{item:7964} to 185"] = "{item:7964}练到185",
		["{item:7964} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 180, grey 185): about 30 crafts to 185. Each takes 1 {item:7912}. One {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits): cheap points between the iron and the steel bracers. Use the stones on your weapons or sell them."] = "{item:7964}在175时为黄色（175黄、180绿、185灰）：大约30次制作可到185。每次需要1个{item:7912}。每次一个{item:7912}（秘银矿脉）：在铁护腕和钢护腕之间便宜的涨点选择。把磨石用在武器上，或者卖掉。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 185"] = "185点的{skill:164}配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:7223} (from 160)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:7223}（160起）。",
		["{item:6040} to 205"] = "{item:6040} 到205",
		["{item:6040} is yellow at 185 (yellow 185, green 197, grey 210): about 39 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 {item:3859} and 2 {spell:3337}. Make the 78 {spell:3337} first. Steel Bars are smelted from an {item:3575} and a Coal ({skill:186} 165; Coal from trade and blacksmithing suppliers), so each bracer is five of each. Each bracer takes two Heavy Grinding Stones: make them first. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 40, {npc:5164} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11177} ({zone:1454}) starts The Art of the {spell:9788}: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 {item:7936} and an {item:7935}, whose plans come from a Mithril Order quest chain. {npc:11146} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11178} ({zone:1454}) starts The Way of the Weaponsmith: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes and 2 Big Black Maces; on Forever the {item:3853} plans ({npc:2482}, {area:35}) and {item:3855} plans bind when picked up, so buy and use them yourself. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3859} (195 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3575} and Coal; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6040}在185时为黄色（185黄、197绿、210灰）：大约39次制作可到205。每次需要5个{item:3859}和2个{spell:3337}。先做好那78个{spell:3337}。钢锭由{item:3575}和煤熔炼而成（{skill:186} 165；煤来自杂货和锻造供应商），所以每个护腕各需五份。每个护腕还要两块重型磨石：先做好。专精（可选）：在200和角色40级时，{npc:5164}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11177}（{zone:1454}）会开启{spell:9788}的专精任务：交4顶华丽的秘银头盔、2个{item:7936}和一个{item:7935}，这些图纸来自秘银会任务链。{npc:11146}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11178}（{zone:1454}）会开启武器铸造师之路：交4把月钢阔剑、4把巨型铁斧、2把重型秘银斧和2把大型黑锤；在Forever中，{item:3853}图纸（{npc:2482}，{area:35}）和{item:3855}图纸拾取即绑定，所以要自己买图纸、自己做。只能选一个；到300都不需要它们，而且测试版从未测过它们（只测到30级）。附近需要铁砧。{item:3859}（150-225需195个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3575}和煤；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:164} 205时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9959} (from 205)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:9959}（205起）。",
		["{item:7930} to 225"] = "{item:7930} 到225",
		["{item:7930} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 16 {item:3860}. Sixteen Mithril Bars a craft and nothing else; orange to 225 on Forever, so a point every craft to the Artisan cap. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (320 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:7930}在205时为橙色（225黄、235绿、245灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要16个{item:3860}。每次十六个秘银锭，别无他物；在Forever中到225都是橙色，所以每次一点直冲大师级上限。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（150-225需320个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:164} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Artisan {skill:164}"] = "专家级{skill:164}",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:16640} (from 225), {spell:9968} (from 210), {spell:9920} (from 175), {spell:10001} (from 205) and {spell:16639} (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 60s of recipes, plus 44 {item:1210}, 596 {item:3860}, 142 {item:4304}, 19 {item:7909}, 19 {item:7910}, 44 {item:7912}, 11 {item:7971}, 206 {item:8170}, 2026 {item:12359}, 801 {item:12365} and 10 {item:12799} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费5金（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:164} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:16640}（225起）、{spell:9968}（210起）、{spell:9920}（175起）、{spell:10001}（205起）和{spell:16639}（225起）。225-300大约花3金60银的配方钱，外加44个{item:1210}、596个{item:3860}、142个{item:4304}、19个{item:7909}、19个{item:7910}、44个{item:7912}、11个{item:7971}、206个{item:8170}、2026个{item:12359}、801个{item:12365}和10个{item:12799}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{item:12819} teaches {item:12773} ({skill:164} 250) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12819}教{item:12773}（{skill:164} 250），售价1金60银。出售者{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）。",
		["{item:12823} teaches {item:12775} ({skill:164} 255) for 2g. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12823}教{item:12775}（{skill:164} 255），售价2金。出售者{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）。",
		["{item:4304} (Alliance)"] = "{item:4304}（联盟）",
		["142 {item:4304} for {item:7933} and {item:7945}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 38-50; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2729}, {npc:2730}, {npc:2732} and {npc:2734} here (level 38-50); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "142个{item:4304}，用于{item:7933}和{item:7945}：{skill:393}：38-50级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:2729}、{npc:2730}、{npc:2732}和{npc:2734}（38-50级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["{item:4304} (Horde)"] = "{item:4304}（部落）",
		["142 {item:4304} for {item:7933} and {item:7945}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 38-50; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:5292}, {npc:5300}, {npc:5304}, {npc:5272}, {npc:5260}, {npc:5262}, {npc:5268}, {npc:5274}, {npc:5287}, {npc:5286} and {npc:5296} here (level 38-50); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "142个{item:4304}，用于{item:7933}和{item:7945}：{skill:393}：38-50级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:5292}、{npc:5300}、{npc:5304}、{npc:5272}、{npc:5260}、{npc:5262}、{npc:5268}、{npc:5274}、{npc:5287}、{npc:5286}和{npc:5296}（38-50级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["44 {item:7912} for {item:7945}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "44个{item:7912}，用于{item:7945}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1425}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["44 {item:7912} for {item:7945}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "44个{item:7912}，用于{item:7945}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1443}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1443}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:8170} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8170}（联盟）",
		["206 {item:8170} for {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1815}, {npc:1816} and {npc:1817} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "206个{item:8170}，用于{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:393}：48-60级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:1815}、{npc:1816}和{npc:1817}（48-60级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["{item:8170} (Horde)"] = "{item:8170}（部落）",
		["206 {item:8170} for {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:6369}, {npc:8760}, {npc:6380}, {npc:6379}, {npc:6378} and {npc:6377} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "206个{item:8170}，用于{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:393}：48-60级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:6369}、{npc:8760}、{npc:6380}、{npc:6379}、{npc:6378}和{npc:6377}（48-60级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["{item:12365} (Alliance)"] = "{item:12365}（联盟）",
		["801 {item:12365} for {item:12643}, {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:186}: {object:324} (skill 245) in {zone:1419} (45-55), {zone:1448} (48-55) and {zone:1452} (55-60); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:324} in {zone:1419} is marked."] = "801个{item:12365}，用于{item:12643}、{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:186}：{object:324}（技能245）产自{zone:1419}（45-55）、{zone:1448}（48-55）和{zone:1452}（55-60）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1419}中{object:324}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:12365} (Horde)"] = "{item:12365}（部落）",
		["801 {item:12365} for {item:12643}, {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:186}: {object:324} (skill 245) in {zone:1448} (48-55), {zone:1451} (55-60) and {zone:1452} (55-60); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:324} in {zone:1448} is marked."] = "801个{item:12365}，用于{item:12643}、{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:186}：{object:324}（技能245）产自{zone:1448}（48-55）、{zone:1451}（55-60）和{zone:1452}（55-60）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1448}中{object:324}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:12643} to 235"] = "{item:12643}练到235",
		["{item:12643} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 232, grey 235): about 17 crafts to 235. Each takes 1 {item:12365}. One {item:12365} a craft (Thorium veins): cheap points at the start of Artisan."] = "{item:12643}在225时为橙色（230黄、232绿、235灰）：大约17次制作可到235。每次需要1个{item:12365}。每次一个{item:12365}（瑟银矿脉）：大师级开头便宜的涨点选择。",
		["{item:7933} to 247"] = "{item:7933} 到247",
		["{item:7933} is yellow at 235 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 30 crafts to 247. Each takes 14 {item:3860} and 4 {item:4304}. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; {item:4304} from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (596 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:7933}在235时为黄色（230黄、240绿、250灰）：大约30次制作可到247。每次需要14个{item:3860}和4个{item:4304}。秘银锭来自秘银矿脉；{item:4304}来自剥皮者或拍卖行。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（225-300需596个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:7945} to 250"] = "{item:7945} 到250",
		["{item:7945} is green at 247 (yellow 230, green 242, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 250. Each takes 16 {item:3860}, 1 {item:7971}, 4 {item:1210}, 1 {item:7966} and 2 {item:4304}. Make the 11 {item:7966} first. Only about 11 crafts to bridge 247-250, but each wants four Shadowgems (about one {object:1732} in a hundred) and a {item:7971}: buy those at the Auction House unless your bags already hold them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:1210} (44 for 225-300): {item:1210} turns up in about one {object:1731}, {object:1732} or {object:1733} in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7971} (11 for 225-300): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find."] = "{item:7945}在247时为绿色（230黄、242绿、255灰）：大约11次制作可到250。每次需要16个{item:3860}、1个{item:7971}、4个{item:1210}、1个{item:7966}和2个{item:4304}。先做好那11个{item:7966}。跨过247-250只需约11次制作，但每次都要四块影宝石（约百分之一的{object:1732}）和一个{item:7971}：除非包里已有，否则去拍卖行买。附近需要铁砧。{item:1210}（225-300需44个）：{item:1210}在约百分之一的{object:1731}、{object:1732}或{object:1733}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:7971}（225-300需11个）：{item:7971}是稀有掉落（没有哪种怪物能达到五十分之一的掉率）：在拍卖行买，或留着你找到的。",
		["{item:12773} to 255"] = "{item:12773} 到255",
		["{item:12773} is orange at 250 (yellow 275, green 287, grey 300): about 5 crafts to 255, a point every craft. Each takes 20 {item:12359}, 2 {item:12799}, 2 {item:12644} and 4 {item:8170}. Make the 10 {item:12644} first. {item:12799} turns up in about one Thorium vein in 130: buy the ten at the Auction House. Five crafts only, until the battleaxe plans can be used at 255. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (2026 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House. {item:12799} (10 for 225-300): {item:12799} turns up in about one {object:175404}, {object:177388} or {object:180215} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining."] = "{item:12773}在250时为橙色（275黄、287绿、300灰）：大约5次制作可到255，每次一点。每次需要20个{item:12359}、2个{item:12799}、2个{item:12644}和4个{item:8170}。先做好那10个{item:12644}。{item:12799}在约一百三十分之一的瑟银矿脉中出现：在拍卖行买十个。只需五次制作，到255就能改用巨斧图纸。附近需要铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300需2026个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:10620}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:12799}（225-300需10个）：{item:12799}在约一百四十三分之一的{object:175404}、{object:177388}或{object:180215}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包里的配方",
		["{item:12775} to 285"] = "{item:12775} 到285",
		["{item:12775} is orange at 255 (yellow 280, green 292, grey 305): about 31 crafts to 285. Each takes 40 {item:12359}, 6 {item:12644} and 6 {item:8170}. Make the 186 {item:12644} first. Plans from {npc:11278} ({area:2298}, {zone:1422}), unlimited stock, but they bind when picked up. Forty Thorium Bars and six Dense Grinding Stones a craft: the dearest stretch, so stop where the {quest:7654} take over. Other ways through: world-drop plans from the Auction House (the Radiant pieces: about 820 Thorium Bars and 190 Hearts of Fire for the Radiant route) or the Merchant's Favor sets. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:12775}在255时为橙色（280黄、292绿、305灰）：大约31次制作可到285。每次需要40个{item:12359}、6个{item:12644}和6个{item:8170}。先做好那186个{item:12644}。图纸由{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}的{area:2298}）出售，不限量，但拾取即绑定。每次四十个瑟银锭和六个致密磨石：最贵的一段，所以到{quest:7654}接手时就停手。其他路径：拍卖行的世界掉落图纸（“光辉”系列：这条路线约需820个瑟银锭和190个火焰之心），或商人的恩惠套装。附近需要铁砧。",
		["{npc:14567} ({zone:1446}) trades {item:12700} ({skill:164} 270) for 40 {item:12359} in {quest:7654}, which needs {skill:164} 265 and character level 50; take {quest:7652} first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up."] = "{npc:14567}（{zone:1446}）在{quest:7654}中以40个{item:12359}换取{item:12700}（{skill:164} 270），该任务需要{skill:164} 265和角色50级；先接{quest:7652}（它不要求任何东西）。图纸拾取即绑定。",
		["{item:12426} to 300"] = "{item:12426} 到300",
		["{item:12426} is orange at 285 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 19 crafts to 300. Each takes 34 {item:12359}, 1 {item:7910} and 1 {item:7909}. About 34 Thorium Bars a craft against the battleaxe's 40 and its grinding stones, orange to 290. Below character level 50 {npc:14567} has no quest for you: keep making Huge Thorium Battleaxes to 300 instead (yellow to 292, grey at 305: about twice the Thorium Bars). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:7909} (19 for 225-300): {item:7909} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 500: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7910} (19 for 225-300): {item:7910} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {skill:164} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:12426}在285时为橙色（290黄、300绿、310灰）：大约19次制作可到300。每次需要34个{item:12359}、1个{item:7910}和1个{item:7909}。每次约需34个瑟银锭，而战斧每次要40个外加磨石，且到290都还是橙色。角色未满50级时{npc:14567}没有任务给你：那就继续做巨型瑟银战斧冲到300（292黄、305灰：约需两倍的瑟银锭）。附近需要铁砧。{item:7909}（225-300需19个）：{item:7909}在约五百分之一的{object:2047}或{object:123309}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:7910}（225-300需19个）：{item:7910}在约一百四十三分之一的{object:2047}或{object:123309}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{skill:164} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/cooking"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:185}"] = "学习{skill:185}",
		["Any {skill:185} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:185} (character level 5, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever: every cook knows {object:29784}. Craft a {item:279981} from one {item:4470} (38c) with {item:4471} (1s 35c, kept in your bags), then place the kit to light a cooking fire anywhere; make a few in advance (one use every 5 minutes). The first kits also raise {skill:185} to about 5. The Camping 101: {skill:185} quest at your starting area's camp sends you to this trainer."] = "本阵营任意{skill:185}训练师都教学徒级{skill:185}（角色5级，1银）；箭头会指向最近的一位。Forever：每个厨师都会{object:29784}。用一个{item:4470}（38铜）加{item:4471}（1银35铜，放在背包里）制作一个{item:279981}，然后放置这套工具，就能在任何地方点燃烹饪火堆；提前做几个（每5分钟可用一次）。最初的几套工具还能把{skill:185}提升到约5点。起始区域营地的“露营入门：{skill:185}”任务会让你去找这位训练师。",
		["{spell:2538}: ingredients"] = "{spell:2538}：材料",
		["Prowler (86%) in {zone:1429}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "觅食的灰狼（86%），在{zone:1429}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["{spell:2538} is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, green at 65, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}."] = "{spell:2538}从1起为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：做到50约需50次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。",
		["{spell:2540}: ingredients"] = "{spell:2540}：材料",
		["{npc:1126} (36%), {npc:1125} (34%) in {zone:1426}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1426}的{npc:1126}（36%）、{npc:1125}（34%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2540} is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, green at 65, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}."] = "{spell:2540}从1起为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：做到50约需50次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。",
		["{item:6888}: shopping"] = "{item:6888}：采购",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 50 {item:2678} (1s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要50个{item:2678}（1银）。",
		["{item:6888}: ingredients"] = "{item:6888}：材料",
		["{npc:1995} (58%) in {zone:1438}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1438}的{npc:1995}（58%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{item:6888} is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, green at 65, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:6888} comes with {skill:185} (the client teaches it with the skill); {item:2678} are a cooking vendor's. The Strigid owls of {zone:1438} drop a {item:6889} more often than not, and {zone:1439}'s moonkin drop them too. Fishers can cook {item:6290} (recipe 40c) from Rut'theran's waters instead, and {npc:6286} in {area:186} gives Recipe of the Kaldorei (seven Small Spider Legs from the Webwood spiders) for {item:5472}, orange from 10 to 50."] = "{item:6888}从1起为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：做到50约需50次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:6888}随{skill:185}一起学会（客户端会随技能教授）；{item:2678}则向烹饪商人购买。{zone:1438}的夜枭多数时候会掉{item:6889}，{zone:1439}的枭兽也会掉。渔夫可以改用鲁瑟兰水域的{item:6290}（配方40铜）来烹饪，而{area:186}的{npc:6286}会用{item:5472}换“卡多雷的食谱”（需要七条蛛网蜘蛛的小蜘蛛腿），10到50点均为橙色。",
		["{npc:250873} in Zephras Isle, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{npc:250873}在泽弗拉斯岛，或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2538} is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, green at 65, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. The Vuldren of Zephras Isle drop {item:2672}."] = "{spell:2538}从1起为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：做到50约需50次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。泽弗拉斯岛的鹫龙会掉落{item:2672}。",
		["{npc:3099} (99%) in {zone:1411}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1411}的{npc:3099}（99%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{npc:2960} (82%), {npc:2959} (77%) in {zone:1412}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{npc:2960}（82%）、{npc:2959}（77%），在{zone:1412}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["{npc:1547} (72%), {npc:1548} (33%) in {zone:1420}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1420}的{npc:1547}（72%）、{npc:1548}（33%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["Journeyman {skill:185}"] = "中级{skill:185}",
		["Journeyman {skill:185} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:185} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中级{skill:185}把上限提高到150；需要技能50和角色10级：箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:185}训练师；训练费5银。",
		["{spell:2541}: ingredients"] = "{spell:2541}：材料",
		["{npc:834} (54%), {npc:833} (51%) in {zone:1436}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1436}的{npc:834}（54%）、{npc:833}（51%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2541} is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, green at 110, grey at 130): about 40 crafts to 90. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 50 for 1s. Coyotes roam the middle of {zone:1436}; {npc:235} on the farm north of {area:108} also gives {item:733} and {item:724} quests that use what you loot here."] = "{spell:2541}从50起为橙色（90黄、110绿、130灰）：做到90约需40次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。任何{skill:185}训练师都会从技能50起以1银教授它。郊狼在{zone:1436}中部游荡；{area:108}以北农场的{npc:235}还会给需要此处战利品的{item:733}和{item:724}任务。",
		["{spell:2544}: shopping"] = "{spell:2544}：采购",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 44 {item:2678} (90c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要44个{item:2678}（90铜）。",
		["{spell:2544}: ingredients"] = "{spell:2544}：材料",
		["{npc:830} (43%) in {zone:1436}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1436}的{npc:830}（43%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2544} is orange from 90 (yellow at 115, green at 135, grey at 155): about 44 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 75 for 2s. Crawlers line the whole {zone:1436} coast. Cook it to 130, where {spell:3376} takes over."] = "{spell:2544}从90起为橙色（115黄、135绿、155灰）：做到130约需44次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。任何{skill:185}训练师都会从技能75起以2银教授它。爬行者遍布{zone:1436}整条海岸。做到130，之后改用{spell:3376}。",
		["{item:6890}: shopping"] = "{item:6890}：采购",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item."] = "箭头会为每种物品指向本阵营最近的商人。",
		["{item:6890}: ingredients"] = "{item:6890}：材料",
		["{npc:1189} (39%) in {zone:1432}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1432}的{npc:1189}（39%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{item:6890} is orange from 50 (yellow at 80, green at 100, grey at 120): about 30 crafts to 80. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:6892} costs 2s 50c at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. Black bears roam the hills of {zone:1432}."] = "{item:6890}从50起为橙色（80黄、100绿、120灰）：做到80约需30次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:6892}在商人处售价2银50铜；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。黑熊在{zone:1432}的丘陵游荡。",
		["{spell:2546}: shopping"] = "{spell:2546}：采购",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:2678} (1s 10c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要52个{item:2678}（1银10铜）。",
		["{spell:2546}: ingredients"] = "{spell:2546}：材料",
		["{npc:1191} (31%) in {zone:1432}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1432}的{npc:1191}（31%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2546} is orange from 80 (yellow at 120, green at 140, grey at 160): about 52 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 80 for 1s 50c. Mountain boars roam all of {zone:1432}. Cook it to 130, where {spell:3376} takes over."] = "{spell:2546}从80起为橙色（120黄、140绿、160灰）：做到130约需52次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。任何{skill:185}训练师都会从技能80起以1银50铜教授它。山地野猪遍布{zone:1432}。做到130，之后改用{spell:3376}。",
		["{item:5525}: shopping"] = "{item:5525}：采购",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 40 {item:159} (2s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要40个{item:159}（2银）。",
		["{item:5525}: ingredients"] = "{item:5525}：材料",
		["{npc:3812} (42%), {npc:3814} (42%), {npc:3944} (42%) in {zone:1439}, or wherever the arrow points; open each {item:5523} for its {item:5503}"] = "{zone:1439}的{npc:3812}（42%）、{npc:3814}（42%）、{npc:3944}（42%），或箭头指向的任何地方；打开每个{item:5523}获取其中的{item:5503}",
		["{item:5525} is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, green at 110, grey at 130): about 40 crafts to 90. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 50 for 1s. The same coastal crawlers drop {item:2674} for {spell:2544} next: keep it."] = "{item:5525}从50起为橙色（90黄、110绿、130灰）：做到90约需40次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。任何{skill:185}训练师都会从技能50起以1银教授它。同样的海岸爬行者还会掉落下一步{spell:2544}所需的{item:2674}：留着。",
		["{npc:3814} (42%), {npc:3812} (40%) in {zone:1439}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1439}的{npc:3814}（42%）、{npc:3812}（40%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:2544} is orange from 90 (yellow at 115, green at 135, grey at 155): about 44 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 75 for 2s. Crawlers line the whole {zone:1439} coast. Cook it to 130, where {spell:3376} takes over."] = "{spell:2544}从90起为橙色（115黄、135绿、155灰）：做到130约需44次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。任何{skill:185}训练师都会从技能75起以2银教授它。爬行者遍布{zone:1439}整条海岸。做到130，之后改用{spell:3376}。",
		["{item:5477}: shopping"] = "{item:5477}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:4536} (2s 75c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要52个{item:4536}（2银75铜）。",
		["{item:5477}: ingredients"] = "{item:5477}：材料",
		["{npc:3246} (32%) in {zone:1413}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1413}的{npc:3246}（32%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{item:5477} is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, green at 110, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:5486} costs 4s 40c at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction."] = "{item:5477}从50起为橙色（90黄、110绿、130灰）：做到100约需52次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:5486}在商人处售价4银40铜；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。",
		["{item:5479}: shopping"] = "{item:5479}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 30 {item:2692} (12s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要30个{item:2692}（12银）。",
		["{item:5479}: ingredients"] = "{item:5479}：材料",
		["{npc:3239} (59%), Owatanka (35%) in {zone:1413}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{npc:3239}（59%）、奥瓦坦卡（35%），在{zone:1413}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["{item:5479} is orange from 100 (yellow at 140, green at 160, grey at 180): about 30 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:5488} costs 4s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {npc:3489}, the butcher beside this vendor at the Crossroads, sells {item:3735} (18s), the recipe after Expert: buy it now."] = "{item:5479}从100起为橙色（140黄、160绿、180灰）：做到130约需30次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:5488}在商人处售价4银；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。十字路口这位商人旁的屠夫{npc:3489}出售{item:3735}（18银），即高级之后的配方：现在就买下。",
		["Expert {skill:185}"] = "高级{skill:185}",
		["Expert {skill:185} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16072} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it."] = "高级{skill:185}把上限提高到225；需要技能125和角色20级：它是一本书，{item:16072}（1金）；箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家。买下并阅读。",
		["Buy and read {item:16072} (Expert {skill:185})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16072}（高级{skill:185}）",
		["{spell:3376}: shopping"] = "{spell:3376}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 46 {item:2692} (18s 40c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要46个{item:2692}（18银40铜）。",
		["{spell:3376}: ingredients"] = "{spell:3376}：材料",
		["{npc:1018} (72%), {npc:1019} (67%) in {zone:1437}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{npc:1018}（72%）、{npc:1019}（67%），在{zone:1437}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["{spell:3376} is orange from 130 (yellow at 170, green at 190, grey at 210): about 46 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:3682} costs 16s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. The raptors of the {zone:1437} drop a {item:3685} about two kills in three. {npc:340} in {zone:1453} sells the recipe."] = "{spell:3376}从130起为橙色（170黄、190绿、210灰）：做到175约需46次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:3682}在商人处售价16银；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。{zone:1437}的迅猛龙约每三次击杀掉一次{item:3685}。{zone:1453}的{npc:340}出售配方。",
		["{spell:3398}: shopping"] = "{spell:3398}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 45 {item:2692} (18s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要45个{item:2692}（18银）。",
		["{spell:3398}: ingredients"] = "{spell:3398}：材料",
		["{npc:2384} (42%) in {zone:1424}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1424}的{npc:2384}（42%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{spell:3398} is orange from 130 (yellow at 175, green at 195, grey at 215): about 45 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:3735} costs 18s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. The Feral and Hulking Mountain Lions of Hillsbrad Foothills drop {item:3731} more often than the Starving ones."] = "{spell:3398}从130起为橙色（175黄、195绿、215灰）：做到175约需45次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:3735}在商人处售价18银；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。希尔斯布莱德丘陵的凶猛山地狮和魁梧山地狮比饥饿山地狮更常掉落{item:3731}。",
		["{item:12210}: shopping"] = "{item:12210}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:2692} (20s 80c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要52个{item:2692}（20银80铜）。",
		["{item:12210}: ingredients"] = "{item:12210}：材料",
		["{npc:2560} (38%) in {zone:1417}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1417}的{npc:2560}（38%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{item:12210} is orange from 175 (yellow at 215, green at 235, grey at 255): about 52 crafts to 225. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:12228} costs 50s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {zone:1417}: {npc:2810} at {area:320} (Alliance) and {npc:2821} at {area:321} (Horde) sell the recipe and {item:2692} beside the raptors. {item:17222} (any trainer from 200, 40s) is the alternative, but it takes two {item:12205} a craft and Dustwallow's spiders drop one about two kills in five."] = "{item:12210}从175起为橙色（215黄、235绿、255灰）：做到225约需52次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:12228}在商人处售价50银；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。{zone:1417}：{area:320}的{npc:2810}（联盟）和{area:321}的{npc:2821}（部落）在迅猛龙旁出售配方和{item:2692}。替代品是{item:17222}（200点起任何训练师可教，40银），但每次需要两个{item:12205}，而尘泥沼泽的蜘蛛约每五次击杀掉落两次。",
		["Artisan {skill:185} comes from {npc:8125} in {area:976} ({zone:1446}). The cooking trainer in {zone:1455} sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:185}由{area:976}（{zone:1446}）的{npc:8125}教授。{zone:1455}的烹饪训练师会指引你前往；需要技能225和等级35级。",
		["Artisan {skill:185} comes from {npc:8125} in {area:976} ({zone:1446}). The cooking trainer in {zone:1454} sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:185}由{area:976}（{zone:1446}）的{npc:8125}教授。{zone:1454}的烹饪训练师会指引你前往；需要技能225和等级35级。",
		["Giant Eggs"] = "巨蛋",
		["{quest:6610} asks for 12 Giant Eggs, 10 {item:7974} and 20 {item:8932}: bring all three before you go to {zone:1446}, so you make the trip once. Giant Eggs drop from the owlbeasts of {zone:1425}: {npc:2929} (54%). {item:12218} takes about 120 more after Artisan: farm them now too if you like."] = "{quest:6610}需要12枚巨型蛋、10个{item:7974}和20个{item:8932}：去{zone:1446}之前把三样都备齐，这样只需跑一趟。巨型蛋由{zone:1425}的枭兽掉落：{npc:2929}（54%）。大师级之后{item:12218}还需要约120个，愿意的话也可以现在一起刷。",
		["Innkeepers and food vendors sell {item:8932}; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "旅店老板和食品商人都出售{item:8932}；箭头会指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:7974} comes from Big-mouth Clams: open each one, every clam holds one. The Muckshell crabs on the {zone:1445} coast south-west of Theramore drop a clam about seven kills in ten, so ten clams take about fifteen kills, on your way to {zone:1446}. The Steeljaw Snappers on {zone:1446}'s east coast drop them about one kill in three."] = "{item:7974}来自大嘴蛤蜊：每个都要打开，每只蛤蜊里都有一个。塞拉摩西南{zone:1445}海岸的泥壳蟹约每十次击杀掉落七次蛤蜊，所以十个蛤蜊约需十五次击杀，正好在去{zone:1446}的路上。{zone:1446}东海岸的钢颚钳嘴龟约每三次击杀掉一次。",
		["Artisan {skill:185}"] = "专家级{skill:185}",
		["{item:12218}: shopping"] = "{item:12218}：购物",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 240 {item:3713} (3g 84s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品指向本阵营最近的商人。你需要240个{item:3713}（3金84银）。",
		["{item:12218}: ingredients"] = "{item:12218}：材料",
		["{npc:2929} (54%) in {zone:1425}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1425}的{npc:2929}（54%），或箭头指向的任何地方",
		["{item:12218} is orange from 225 (yellow at 265, green at 285, grey at 305): about 120 crafts to 300. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:16110} costs 1g 20s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {item:12218} is orange to 265 and green from 285, yet it still carries you to 300. Fishers can finish on {item:13931} ({npc:8137}, {area:977}; yellow to 310) instead; {item:13932} needs an {item:279982} on Forever."] = "{item:12218}从225起为橙色（265黄、285绿、305灰）：做到300约需120次。在任何火堆旁烹饪：城镇炉火或你自己的{object:29784}。{item:16110}在商人处售价1金20银；箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。{item:12218}到265仍是橙色、285起转绿，但仍能一路带到300。渔夫可以改用{item:13931}收尾（{npc:8137}，{area:977}；到310仍为黄色）；{item:13932}在Forever需要一个{item:279982}。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/enchanting"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:333}"] = "学习{skill:333}",
		["Apprentice {skill:333} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Not every {skill:333} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:3606} ({zone:1438}), {npc:11068} ({zone:1453}), {npc:257004} (Zephras Isle), {npc:5157} ({zone:1455}), {npc:11072} ({zone:1429}), {npc:11070} ({zone:1457}), {npc:1317} ({zone:1453}), {npc:257020} (Zephras Isle), {npc:4213} ({zone:1457}), {npc:11065} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5158} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:7949} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:257004} (Zephras Isle), {npc:3345} ({zone:1454}), {npc:11074} ({zone:1442}), Jhag ({zone:1454}), {npc:4616} ({zone:1458}), {npc:11067} ({zone:1458}), {npc:11071} ({zone:1456}), {npc:257020} (Zephras Isle), {npc:3011} ({zone:1456}) and {npc:5695} ({zone:1420}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Buy a {item:6217} and {item:247786} from an enchanting supplies vendor (in the capitals and on Zephras Isle; the starting-area trainers have none beside them, and the next step's arrow picks the nearest). From now on, disenchant every green you do not wear: that is where the dust and essences come from. Two starter quests teach Disenchant on a quest item: An Enchanting Lesson from {npc:11072} ({area:91}, {zone:1429}) and A Pain in the Neck from {npc:266881} ({area:367}, {zone:1411}). 1-75 takes about 50c of recipes and 4s 44c of vendor goods, plus 51 {item:10940} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:333}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。并非每位{skill:333}训练师都教：联盟有{npc:3606}（{zone:1438}）、{npc:11068}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:257004}（泽弗拉斯岛）、{npc:5157}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}）、{npc:11070}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:1317}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:257020}（泽弗拉斯岛）、{npc:4213}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:11065}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5158}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:7949}（{zone:1444}）；部落有{npc:257004}（泽弗拉斯岛）、{npc:3345}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:11074}（{zone:1442}）、Jhag（{zone:1454}）、{npc:4616}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:11067}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:11071}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:257020}（泽弗拉斯岛）、{npc:3011}（{zone:1456}）和{npc:5695}（{zone:1420}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。从附魔用品供应商处买一个{item:6217}和一个{item:247786}（主城和泽弗拉斯岛都有；新手地区的训练师身边没有，下一步的箭头会指向最近的一位）。从现在起，把不穿的绿装全部分解：尘和精华就是这么来的。两个新手任务会用任务物品教你分解：“附魔入门课”来自{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}的{area:91}），“脖子上的麻烦”来自{npc:266881}（{zone:1411}的{area:367}）。1-75大约花50铜的配方钱和4银44铜的商人货物，外加51个{item:10940}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:333} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 1-75：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 1 {item:6217} (1s 24c) and 32 {item:247786} (3s 20c); about 4s 44c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286} and {npc:1318}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3346} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：1个{item:6217}（1银24铜）和32个{item:247786}（3银20铜）；总共约4银44铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}和{npc:1318}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3346}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["{spell:7418} to 25"] = "{spell:7418}练到25",
		["{spell:7418} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 22, grey 25): about 31 crafts to 25. Each takes 1 {item:247786}. One {item:247786} (10c) a craft; grey at 25 on Forever. Make the {item:6218} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7418}在1时为橙色（20黄、22绿、25灰）：大约31次制作可到25。每次需要1个{item:247786}。每次约耗一个{item:247786}（10铜）；在Forever中25时变灰。先做好{item:6218}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["a tool: keep it in your bags"] = "工具：放在背包里",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 25"] = "{skill:333} 25时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:333} trainer: {spell:7420} (from 15, 50c). Also learn {spell:1230643} (1s): Forever's {skill:333} camp item, 1 {item:4470} and 1 {item:10940}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:333} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an enchanting trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:333}训练师处：{spell:7420}（15起，50铜）。同时学习{spell:1230643}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:333}露营物品，需1个{item:4470}和1个{item:10940}，放在营火旁的营地以获得增益。“露营入门：{skill:333}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的附魔训练师那里。",
		["{spell:7420} to 75"] = "{spell:7420} 到75",
		["{spell:7420} is orange at 25 (yellow 70, green 90, grey 110): about 51 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 {item:10940}. One {item:10940} a craft: the dust most level 5-20 greens break into, armour above all. {item:10938} (from weapons) does the same job through Bracer - Minor Deflect or Chest - {spell:7423} if you have more of it. {item:10940} (51 for 1-75): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-20; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7420}在25时为橙色（70黄、90绿、110灰）：大约51次制作可到75。每次需要1个{item:10940}。每次约耗一个{item:10940}：大多数5-20级绿装（尤其是护甲）分解出的尘。{item:10938}（来自武器）若你存量更多，也能靠“护腕 - 次级偏斜”或“胸甲 - {spell:7423}”这两个配方顶替。{item:10940}（1-75需51个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级5-20的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["Journeyman {skill:333}"] = "中级{skill:333}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:333} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:5157} ({zone:1455}), {npc:11072} ({zone:1429}), {npc:1317} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4213} ({zone:1457}) and {npc:7949} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:3345} ({zone:1454}), {npc:11074} ({zone:1442}), {npc:4616} ({zone:1458}) and {npc:3011} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:7771} (from 70, 2s). 75-150 takes about 2s of recipes, plus 1 {item:1210}, 1 {item:6338}, 4 {item:10938}, 121 {item:10940} and 20 {item:11083} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:333} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:333}训练师都教：联盟{npc:5157}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}）、{npc:1317}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4213}（{zone:1457}）和{npc:7949}（{zone:1444}）；部落{npc:3345}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:11074}（{zone:1442}）、{npc:4616}（{zone:1458}）和{npc:3011}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:7771}（70起，2银）。75-150大约花2银的配方钱，外加1个{item:1210}、1个{item:6338}、4个{item:10938}、121个{item:10940}和20个{item:11083}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{spell:7420} to 90"] = "{spell:7420} 到90",
		["{spell:7420} is yellow at 75 (yellow 70, green 90, grey 110): about 22 crafts to 90. Each takes 1 {item:10940}. One {item:10940} a craft: the dust most level 5-20 greens break into, armour above all. {item:10938} (from weapons) does the same job through Bracer - Minor Deflect or Chest - {spell:7423} if you have more of it. {item:10940} (121 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-20; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7420}在75时为黄色（70黄、90绿、110灰）：大约22次制作可到90。每次需要1个{item:10940}。每次约耗一个{item:10940}：大多数5-20级绿装（尤其是护甲）分解出的尘。{item:10938}（来自武器）若你存量更多，也能靠“护腕 - 次级偏斜”或“胸甲 - {spell:7423}”这两个配方顶替。{item:10940}（75-150需121个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级5-20的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{spell:7771} to 130"] = "{spell:7771} 到130",
		["{spell:7771} is orange at 90 (yellow 110, green 130, grey 150): about 48 crafts to 130. Each takes 2 {item:10940}. Two {item:10940} a craft (the trainer teaches it from 70 for 2s); keep disenchanting the greens of the 10-20 zones. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7771}在90时为橙色（110黄、130绿、150灰）：大约48次制作可到130。每次需要2个{item:10940}。每次两份{item:10940}（训练师从70起教，收费2银）；继续分解10-20级区域的绿装。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 130"] = "130点的{skill:333}配方",
		["Back to an {skill:333} trainer: {spell:7795} (from 100) and {spell:13501} (from 130)."] = "回到{skill:333}训练师处：{spell:7795}（100起）和{spell:13501}（130起）。",
		["{spell:13501} to 150"] = "{spell:13501} 到150",
		["{spell:13501} is orange at 130 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 20 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:6339} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:1210} (1 for 75-150): {item:1210} turns up in about one {object:1731}, {object:1732} or {object:1733} in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:6338} (1 for 75-150): {skill:164}: {item:6338}; or the Auction House. {item:10938} (4 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-15; or the Auction House. {item:11083} (20 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 21-30; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13501}在130时为橙色（155黄、175绿、195灰）：大约20次制作可到150，每次一点。每次需要1个{item:11083}。每次一点约耗一个{item:11083}（21-30级绿装）。先做好{item:6339}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:1210}（75-150需1个）：{item:1210}在约百分之一的{object:1731}、{object:1732}或{object:1733}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:6338}（75-150需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:6338}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:10938}（75-150需4个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级5-15的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11083}（75-150需20个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级21-30的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
		["{item:5500} (Alliance)"] = "{item:5500}（联盟）",
		["1 {item:5500} for {item:11130}: open the Giant Clams at the marked spot, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "1个{item:5500}，用于{item:11130}：在标记处打开巨型蛤蜊，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:5500} (Horde)"] = "{item:5500}（部落）",
		["Expert {skill:333}"] = "高级{skill:333}",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11072} ({zone:1429}); Horde {npc:11074} ({zone:1442}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:13628} (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 {item:5500}, 1 {item:7971}, 1 {item:11082}, 71 {item:11083}, 1 {item:11128}, 1 {item:11135}, 21 {item:11137} and 1 {item:11144} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:13637} (from 160), {item:11145} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:333} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}）；部落{npc:11074}（{zone:1442}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:13628}（150起）。150-225需要1个{item:5500}、1个{item:7971}、1个{item:11082}、71个{item:11083}、1个{item:11128}、1个{item:11135}、21个{item:11137}和1个{item:11144}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{spell:13637}（160起）、{item:11145}（200起）和{spell:13746}（205起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
		["{spell:13501} to 160"] = "{spell:13501} 到160",
		["{spell:13501} is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:11130} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:11082} (1 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 16-25; or the Auction House. {item:11083} (71 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 21-30; or the Auction House. {item:11128} (1 for 150-225): {skill:164}: {item:11128}; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13501}在150时为橙色（155黄、175绿、195灰）：大约11次制作可到160。每次需要1个{item:11083}。每次约耗一个{item:11083}（21-30级绿装）。趁{item:11130}还能涨点时先做出来：后面的配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:11082}（150-225需1个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级16-25的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11083}（150-225需71个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级21-30的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11128}（150-225需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:11128}；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 160"] = "{skill:333} 160时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13637} (from 160)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:13637}（160起）。",
		["{spell:13637} to 205"] = "{spell:13637} 到205",
		["{spell:13637} is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 59 crafts to 205. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. {item:11083} again. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13637}在160时为橙色（180黄、200绿、220灰）：大约59次制作可到205。每次需要1个{item:11083}。又是{item:11083}。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:333} 205时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13702} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:13702}（200起）和{spell:13746}（205起）。",
		["{spell:13746} to 225"] = "{spell:13746} 到225",
		["{spell:13746} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. One {item:11137} a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the {item:11145} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:7971} (1 for 150-225): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. {item:11135} (1 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 26-35; or the Auction House. {item:11137} (21 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40; or the Auction House. {item:11144} (1 for 150-225): {skill:164}: {item:11144}; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13746}在205时为橙色（225黄、245绿、265灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要1个{item:11137}。每次一点约耗一个{item:11137}（31-40级绿装）。先做好{item:11145}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:7971}（150-225需1个）：{item:7971}是稀有掉落（没有哪种怪物能达到五十分之一的掉率）：在拍卖行买，或留着你找到的。{item:11135}（150-225需1个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级26-35的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11137}（150-225需21个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级31-40的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11144}（150-225需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:11144}；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Artisan {skill:333}"] = "专家级{skill:333}",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. {npc:11073} teaches Artisan {skill:333} inside the {area:1517} dungeon ({zone:1418}); bring a group. Learn now: {spell:13815} (from 210). 225-300 takes about 2g 20s of recipes and 1g 70s of vendor goods, plus 34 {item:8831}, 39 {item:11137} and 208 {item:11176} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费5金（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:333} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。{npc:11073}在{area:1517}副本（{zone:1418}）内教授大师级{skill:333}；要带队伍。现在学：{spell:13815}（210起）。225-300大约花2金20银的配方钱和1金70银的商人货物，外加34个{item:8831}、39个{item:11137}和208个{item:11176}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:333} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 225-300：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 34 {item:8925} (1g 70s); about 1g 70s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, Eldraeith and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：34个{item:8925}（1金70银）；总共约1金70银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、Eldraeith和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
		["{item:20754} teaches {item:20747} ({skill:333} 250) for 1g. Sold by {npc:15419} ({zone:1451})."] = "{item:20754}教{item:20747}（{skill:333} 250），售价1金。出售者{npc:15419}（{zone:1451}）。",
		["{item:16217} teaches {spell:20017} ({skill:333} 265) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:4229} ({zone:1457}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:4561} ({zone:1458}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:16217}教{spell:20017}（{skill:333} 265），售价1金20银。出售者：联盟{npc:4229}（{zone:1457}），限量；部落{npc:4561}（{zone:1458}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
		["{item:8831} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8831}（联盟）",
		["34 {item:8831} for {item:20747}: {skill:182}: {item:8831} (skill 210) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8831} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "34个{item:8831}，用于{item:20747}：{skill:182}：{item:8831}（技能210）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1425}中{item:8831}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{item:8831} (Horde)"] = "{item:8831}（部落）",
		["34 {item:8831} for {item:20747}: {skill:182}: {item:8831} (skill 210) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest patch of {item:8831} in {zone:1444} is marked."] = "34个{item:8831}，用于{item:20747}：{skill:182}：{item:8831}（技能210）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1444}中{item:8831}最密集的一片已标记。",
		["{spell:13815} to 253"] = "{spell:13815} 到253",
		["{spell:13815} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 250, grey 270): about 39 crafts to 253. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. {npc:11073} teaches it with Artisan: learn it on that visit. {item:11137} again; bring about 40. {item:11137} (39 for 225-300): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13815}在225时为橙色（230黄、250绿、270灰）：大约39次制作可到253。每次需要1个{item:11137}。{npc:11073}会随大师级一并教授：那次造访时学。又是{item:11137}；带约40个。{item:11137}（225-300需39个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级31-40的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{item:20747} to 275"] = "{item:20747} 到275",
		["{item:20747} is orange at 253 (yellow 260, green 270, grey 280): about 34 crafts to 275. Each takes 1 {item:11176}, 1 {item:8831} and 1 {item:8925}. One {item:11176} (level 41-50 greens) and one {item:8831} (herbalists) a craft; the oil sells well. {npc:15419} sells the formula at the inn of {area:3425} ({zone:1451}): fly there, the mobs around it are level 55 and up. {item:11176} (208 for 225-300): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 41-50; or the Auction House."] = "{item:20747}在253时为橙色（260黄、270绿、280灰）：大约34次制作可到275。每次需要1个{item:11176}、1个{item:8831}和1个{item:8925}。每次制作约耗一个{item:11176}（41-50级绿装）和一个{item:8831}（草药师采集）；这油很好卖。{npc:15419}在{area:3425}（{zone:1451}）的旅店出售配方：飞过去吧，周围的怪物是55级以上。{item:11176}（225-300需208个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级41-50的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包里的配方",
		["{spell:20017} to 300"] = "{spell:20017} 到300",
		["{spell:20017} is orange at 275 (yellow 285, green 305, grey 325): about 29 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 {item:11176}. Six {item:11176} a craft: the dearest stretch, so disenchant every level 41-50 green you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:20017}在275时为橙色（285黄、305绿、325灰）：大约29次制作可到300。每次需要6个{item:11176}。每次六份{item:11176}：最贵的一段，所以把找到的每一件41-50级绿装都分解。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/engineering"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:202}"] = "学习{skill:202}",
		["Apprentice {skill:202} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:202} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} are the first parts. 1-75 takes about 4s 15c of recipes and 18s 18c of vendor goods, plus 46 {item:2835} and 75 {item:2840} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:202}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:202}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。买一个{item:5956}，再配合{skill:186}：{item:2835}和{item:2770}是最早的零件。1-75大约花4银15铜的配方钱和18银18铜的商人货物，外加46个{item:2835}和75个{item:2840}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:202} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 1-75：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 18 {item:2880} (18s) and {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18s 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：18个{item:2880}（18银）和{item:5956}（工具：一个，放在包里，18铜）；总共约18银18铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、Gorina和{npc:5817}）。",
		["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "一件工具，放在包里",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1429} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1429}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1426} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1426}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1439} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1439}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:2521} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:2521}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1411} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1411}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1412} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1412}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["46 {item:2835} for {spell:3918}: {skill:186}: {object:1731} (skill 1); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1731} in {zone:1420} is marked."] = "46个{item:2835}，用于{spell:3918}：{skill:186}：{object:1731}（技能1）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1420}中{object:1731}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{spell:3918} to 35"] = "{spell:3918} 到35",
		["{spell:3918} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 46 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft; {item:2835} comes with the {item:2770} from Copper Veins."] = "{spell:3918}在1时为橙色（20黄、30绿、40灰）：大约46次制作可到35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次一个{item:2835}；{item:2835}与铜矿脉出的{item:2770}一同获得。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 35"] = "{skill:202} 35时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3922} (from 30, 1s 15c). Also learn {spell:1230656} (1s): Forever's {skill:202} camp item, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. It takes a {spell:3922} and a {spell:3924}, which you learn at 30 and 50, so it gives no points. The Camping 101: {skill:202} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an engineering trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3922}（30起，1银15铜）。同时学习{spell:1230656}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:202}露营物品，放在营火旁的营地。它需要一把{spell:3922}和一个{spell:3924}，而这两种你在30级和50级就会学，所以不涨点。“露营入门：{skill:202}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的工程学训练师那里。",
		["{spell:3922} to 57"] = "{spell:3922} 到57",
		["{spell:3922} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 52, grey 60): about 33 crafts to 57. Each takes 1 {item:2840}. One {item:2840} a craft. Keep the bolts: Practice Locks and later gadgets take them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (75 for 1-75): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3922}在35时为橙色（45黄、52绿、60灰）：大约33次制作可到57。每次需要1个{item:2840}。每次一个{item:2840}。留着这些螺栓：练习锁和后续装置都要用。附近需要铁砧。{item:5956}是工具：放在包里。{item:2840}（1-75需75个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 57"] = "{skill:202} 57时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:7430} (from 50, 1s 50c) and {spell:3924} (from 50, 1s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:7430}（50起，1银50铜）和{spell:3924}（50起，1银50铜）。",
		["{spell:3924} to 75"] = "{spell:3924} 到75",
		["{spell:3924} is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the {item:6219} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there."] = "{spell:3924}在57时为橙色（80黄、95绿、110灰）：大约18次制作可到75，每次一点。每次需要2个{item:2840}和1个{item:2880}。每次两个铜锭和一个{item:2880}（锻造和工程学供应商）。附近需要铁砧。趁{item:6219}还能涨点时先做出来：后面的配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。",
		["a tool: keep it in your bags"] = "工具：放在背包里",
		["Journeyman {skill:202}"] = "中级{skill:202}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:202} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}), {npc:1676} ({zone:1431}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:11029} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}), {npc:11031} ({zone:1458}), {npc:3412} ({zone:1454}) and Roxxik ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3929} (from 75, 2s 50c) and {spell:3930} (from 75, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 5s of recipes and 45s of vendor goods, plus 15 {item:2836}, 27 {item:2838}, 72 {item:2840}, 61 {item:2841} and 2 {item:2842} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:202}训练师都教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）、{npc:1676}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:11029}（{zone:1455}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）、{npc:11031}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:3412}（{zone:1454}）和罗克希克（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3929}（75起，2银50铜）和{spell:3930}（75起，2银50铜）。75-150大约花5银的配方钱和45银的商人货物，外加15个{item:2836}、27个{item:2838}、72个{item:2840}、61个{item:2841}和2个{item:2842}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:202} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 75-150：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 45 {item:2880} (45s); about 45s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：45个{item:2880}（45银）；总共约45银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、Gorina和{npc:5817}）。",
		["15 {item:2836} for {spell:3930}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1436} is marked."] = "15个{item:2836}，用于{spell:3930}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1436}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["15 {item:2836} for {spell:3930}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1432} is marked."] = "15个{item:2836}，用于{spell:3930}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1432}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["15 {item:2836} for {spell:3930}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1439} is marked."] = "15个{item:2836}，用于{spell:3930}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1439}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["15 {item:2836} for {spell:3930}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "15个{item:2836}，用于{spell:3930}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["15 {item:2836} for {spell:3930}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1421} is marked."] = "15个{item:2836}，用于{spell:3930}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1421}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["27 {item:2838} for {spell:3945}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "27个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3945}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["27 {item:2838} for {spell:3945}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1440} is marked."] = "27个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3945}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1440}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["27 {item:2838} for {spell:3945}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1413} is marked."] = "27个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3945}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1413}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{spell:3930} to 94"] = "{spell:3930} 到94",
		["{spell:3930} is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 {spell:3929} and 1 {item:2840} and makes 200. Make the 15 {spell:3929} first: it gives points too while not grey. The {spell:3929} in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor. {item:2840} (72 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3930}在75时为橙色（85黄、90绿、95灰）：大约15次制作可到94。每次需要1个{spell:3929}和1个{item:2840}，产出200个。先做好那15个{spell:3929}：它在未变灰前也能涨点。每次其中的{spell:3929}在未变灰时也会单独涨一点：一次制作两次机会。把弹药卖给猎人，或卖给商人。{item:2840}（75-150需72个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3924} to 100"] = "{spell:3924} 到100",
		["{spell:3924} is yellow at 94 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 14 crafts to 100. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{spell:3924}在94时为黄色（80黄、95绿、110灰）：大约14次制作可到100。每次需要2个{item:2840}和1个{item:2880}。每次两个铜锭和一个{item:2880}（锻造和工程学供应商）。附近需要铁砧。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 100"] = "{skill:202} 100时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:8334} (from 100)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:8334}（100起）。",
		["{item:6712} to 125"] = "{item:6712} 到125",
		["{item:6712} is orange at 100 (yellow 115, green 122, grey 130): about 31 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 {item:2841}, 2 {spell:3922} and 1 {item:2880}. Make the 29 {spell:3922} first. Use the 33 {spell:3922} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Practice Locks sell to rogues, or open them yourself. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (61 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6712}在100时为橙色（115黄、122绿、130灰）：大约31次制作可到125。每次需要1个{item:2841}、2个{spell:3922}和1个{item:2880}。先做好那29个{spell:3922}。用你先前做好的那33个{spell:3922}；上面的数量未计入它们。练习锁可以卖给盗贼，或者自己开。附近需要铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150需61个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 125"] = "{skill:202} 125 级配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3945} (from 125)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3945}（125起）。",
		["{spell:3945} to 140"] = "{spell:3945} 到140",
		["{spell:3945} is yellow at 125 (yellow 125, green 135, grey 145): about 27 crafts to 140. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. One {item:2838} a craft (Iron Deposits). Keep some: Iron Grenades take one each."] = "{spell:3945}在125时为黄色（125黄、135绿、145灰）：大约27次制作可到140。每次需要1个{item:2838}。每次一个{item:2838}（铁矿脉）。留一些：每个铁手雷都要一个。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 140"] = "{skill:202} 140时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3973} (from 90) and {spell:3950} (from 140)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3973}（90起）和{spell:3950}（140起）。",
		["{spell:3950} to 150"] = "{spell:3950} 到150",
		["{spell:3950} is yellow at 140 (yellow 140, green 165, grey 190): about 10 crafts to 150. Each takes 2 {item:4377}, 3 {item:2841} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 3. Make the 10 {spell:3973} (2 crafts) first. Use the 20 {item:4377} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (2 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3950}在140时为黄色（140黄、165绿、190灰）：大约10次制作可到150。每次需要2个{item:4377}、3个{item:2841}和1个{spell:3973}，产出3个。先做好那10个{spell:3973}（2次制作）。用你先前做好的那20个{item:4377}；上面的数量未计入它们。训练师教这个，而且按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。附近需要铁砧。{item:2842}（75-150需2个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2775}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:202} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Expert {skill:202}"] = "高级{skill:202}",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}) and {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}) and Roxxik ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:9271} (from 150) and {spell:3953} (from 145). 150-225 takes about 31s of vendor goods, plus 19 {item:2319}, 19 {item:2592}, 31 {item:2836}, 74 {item:2838}, 100 {item:2841}, 6 {item:2842}, 81 {item:3575}, 19 {item:3860} and 62 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）和{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）和罗克希克（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:9271}（150起）和{spell:3953}（145起）。150-225大约花31银的商人货物，外加19个{item:2319}、19个{item:2592}、31个{item:2836}、74个{item:2838}、100个{item:2841}、6个{item:2842}、81个{item:3575}、19个{item:3860}和62个{item:7912}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:202} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 150-225：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 31 {item:6530} (31s); about 31s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5494} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3333} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：31个{item:6530}（31银）；总共约31银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5494}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3333}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["{item:2319} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2319}（联盟）",
		["19 {item:2319} for {spell:3953}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 18-30; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2248}, {npc:2356}, {npc:2385}, {npc:2351}, Snapjaw, {npc:2384} and {npc:2354} here (level 18-30); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "19个{item:2319}，用于{spell:3953}：{skill:393}：18-30级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:2248}、{npc:2356}、{npc:2385}、{npc:2351}、钳嘴、{npc:2384}和{npc:2354}（18-30级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["{item:2319} (Horde)"] = "{item:2319}（部落）",
		["19 {item:2319} for {spell:3953}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 18-30; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:3809}, {npc:3810}, {npc:3818}, {npc:3823}, {npc:3811} and {npc:3817} here (level 18-30); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "19个{item:2319}，用于{spell:3953}：{skill:393}：18-30级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:3809}、{npc:3810}、{npc:3818}、{npc:3823}、{npc:3811}和{npc:3817}（18-30级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
		["19 {item:2592} for {spell:3953}: humanoids of level 15-30 drop it; or the Auction House. The arrow picks a farm spot for your level and faction."] = "19个{item:2592}，用于{spell:3953}：15-30级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。箭头会按你的等级和阵营指向一处刷怪点。",
		["{item:2836} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2836}（联盟）",
		["31 {item:2836} for {item:6533}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65) in {zone:1432} (10-20), {zone:1440} (18-30) and {zone:1424} (20-30); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1432} is marked."] = "31个{item:2836}，用于{item:6533}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）产自{zone:1432}（10-20）、{zone:1440}（18-30）和{zone:1424}（20-30）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1432}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:2836} (Horde)"] = "{item:2836}（部落）",
		["31 {item:2836} for {item:6533}: {skill:186}: {object:1732} (skill 65) in {zone:1413} (10-25), {zone:1440} (18-30) and {zone:1424} (20-30); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1732} in {zone:1440} is marked."] = "31个{item:2836}，用于{item:6533}：{skill:186}：{object:1732}（技能65）产自{zone:1413}（10-25）、{zone:1440}（18-30）和{zone:1424}（20-30）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1440}中{object:1732}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:2838} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2838}（联盟）",
		["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1443} (30-40); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "74个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3967}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1417}（30-40）、{zone:1434}（30-45）和{zone:1443}（30-40）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:2838} (Horde)"] = "{item:2838}（部落）",
		["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1441} (25-35), {zone:1417} (30-40) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1441} is marked."] = "74个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3967}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1441}（25-35）、{zone:1417}（30-40）和{zone:1434}（30-45）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1441}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:7912} (Alliance)"] = "{item:7912}（联盟）",
		["62 {item:7912} for {item:10505}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1434} (30-45), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1434} is marked."] = "62个{item:7912}，用于{item:10505}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1434}（30-45）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1434}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:7912} (Horde)"] = "{item:7912}（部落）",
		["62 {item:7912} for {item:10505}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "62个{item:7912}，用于{item:10505}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1443}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1443}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:6533} to 166"] = "{item:6533} 到166",
		["{item:6533} is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 160, grey 170): about 31 crafts to 166. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:6530} and 1 {spell:3929} and makes 3. Make the 31 {spell:3929} first. {item:6530} come from trade and fishing suppliers; the attractors sell to fishermen. {item:2841} (100 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6533}在150时为黄色（150黄、160绿、170灰）：大约31次制作可到166。每次需要2个{item:2841}、1个{item:6530}和1个{spell:3929}，产出3个。先做好那31个{spell:3929}。{item:6530}由杂货和钓鱼供应商出售；这种诱饵卖给渔夫。{item:2841}（150-225需100个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3953} to 175"] = "将{spell:3953}做到 175",
		["{spell:3953} is yellow at 166 (yellow 145, green 170, grey 195): about 19 crafts to 175. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2592}. Bronze Frameworks are parts for later gadgets; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3953}在166时为黄色（145黄、170绿、195灰）：大约19次制作可到175。每次需要2个{item:2841}、1个{item:2319}和1个{item:2592}。青铜框架是后续装置的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 175"] = "{skill:202} 175 级配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12585} (from 175)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12585}（175起）。",
		["{item:10505} to 191"] = "{item:10505} 到191",
		["{item:10505} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 185, grey 195): about 31 crafts to 191. Each takes 2 {item:7912}. Two {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits). Make plenty: the triggers, slugs and Gyro-Shot all use it."] = "{item:10505}在175时为黄色（175黄、185绿、195灰）：大约31次制作可到191。每次需要2个{item:7912}。每次两个{item:7912}（秘银矿脉）。多做些：触发器、弹丸和陀螺弹都要用它。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 191"] = "{skill:202} 191时的配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3967} (from 190)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3967}（190起）。",
		["{spell:3967} to 210"] = "{spell:3967} 到210",
		["{spell:3967} is yellow at 191 (yellow 190, green 210, grey 230): about 27 crafts to 210. Each takes 3 {item:3575}, 3 {spell:3945} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 2. Make the 74 {spell:3945} and 30 {spell:3973} (6 crafts) first. Use the 7 {spell:3945} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. A {item:2842} makes five Silver Contacts (grey by now: no points, but no trip to a vendor either); the {spell:3945} comes from {item:2838}. Each craft makes two bombs. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 30, {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4586} ({zone:1458}) or Tinkerwiz ({area:392}) sends you to {spell:20220} ({npc:7944}, {zone:1455}, or {npc:7406}, {area:35}: 6 Mithril Tubes, an {item:4407} and 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering ({npc:8126}, {area:976}: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 {item:10507} and 5 {npc:2675}). The {item:4407} schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (6 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {item:3575} (81 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3967}在191时为黄色（190黄、210绿、230灰）：大约27次制作可到210。每次需要3个{item:3575}、3个{spell:3945}和1个{spell:3973}，产出2个。先做好那74个{spell:3945}和30个{spell:3973}（6次制作）。用你先前做好的那7个{spell:3945}；上面的数量未计入它们。一个{item:2842}可做五个白银触点（现在已灰：不涨点，但也不用跑商人）；{spell:3945}来自{item:2838}。每次制作产出两个炸弹。专精（可选）：在200技能且角色30级时，{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4586}（{zone:1458}）或廷克维斯（{area:392}）会派你去{spell:20220}（{npc:7944}，{zone:1455}，或{npc:7406}，{area:35}：6根秘银管、一个{item:4407}和2个高级假人）或地精工程学（{npc:8126}，{area:976}：20个大型铁炸弹、20个{item:10507}和5个{npc:2675}）。{item:4407}的图纸现在拾取即绑定，但任务要的是别人做的瞄准镜。会员卡可持续14天游戏时间；续费要2金。只能选一个；冲300都不需要，测试服也从未测过它们（只到30级就结束了）。附近需要铁砧。{item:2842}（150-225需6个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2775}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:3575}（150-225需81个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2772}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 210"] = "{skill:202} 210 级配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12596} (from 210)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12596}（210起）。",
		["{item:10512} to 225"] = "将{item:10512}做到 225",
		["{item:10512} is yellow at 210 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 19 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Use the 19 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (19 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:10512}在210时为黄色（210黄、230绿、250灰）：大约19次制作可到225。每次需要1个{item:3860}和1个{item:10505}，产出200个。用你先前做好的那19个{item:10505}；上面的数量未计入它们。每次一个{item:3860}和一个{item:10505}；猎人们会买这种弹丸。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（150-225需19个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:202} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Artisan {skill:202}"] = "专家级{skill:202}",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 2g 80s of recipes, plus 118 {item:3860}, 212 {item:7912}, 156 {item:12359} and 24 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费4金50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。225-300大约花2金80银的配方钱，外加118个{item:3860}、212个{item:7912}、156个{item:12359}和24个{item:14047}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{item:16042} teaches {item:15994} ({skill:202} 260) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:5175} ({zone:1455}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:3413} ({zone:1454}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too."] = "{item:16042}教{item:15994}（{skill:202} 260），售价1金20银。出售者：联盟{npc:5175}（{zone:1455}），限量；部落{npc:3413}（{zone:1454}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；拍卖行也常有的卖。",
		["{item:16047} teaches {item:16000} ({skill:202} 275) for 1g 60s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:260565} ({zone:2548}) and {npc:11185} ({zone:1452}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:11185} ({zone:1452}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:16047}教{item:16000}（{skill:202} 275），售价1金60银。出售者：联盟{npc:260565}（{zone:2548}）和{npc:11185}（{zone:1452}），限量；部落{npc:11185}（{zone:1452}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
		["212 {item:7912} for {item:10512} and {item:10513}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "212个{item:7912}，用于{item:10512}和{item:10513}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1425}（40-50）、{zone:1444}（40-50）和{zone:1447}（45-55）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1425}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["212 {item:7912} for {item:10512} and {item:10513}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "212个{item:7912}，用于{item:10512}和{item:10513}：{skill:186}：{object:2040}（技能175）产自{zone:1443}（30-40）、{zone:1425}（40-50）和{zone:1444}（40-50）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1443}中{object:2040}最密集的一簇已标记。",
		["{item:14047} (Alliance)"] = "{item:14047}（联盟）",
		["24 {item:14047} for {item:15994}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:7027} (level 56-57) here."] = "24个{item:14047}，用于{item:15994}：45-60级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:7027}（56-57级）掉落。",
		["{item:14047} (Horde)"] = "{item:14047}（部落）",
		["24 {item:14047} for {item:15994}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:11880} (level 57-59) here."] = "24个{item:14047}，用于{item:15994}：45-60级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:11880}（57-59级）掉落。",
		["{item:10512} to 245"] = "将{item:10512}做到 245",
		["{item:10512} is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 50 {item:10505} first. Use the 12 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (118 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:10512}在225时为黄色（210黄、230绿、250灰）：大约62次制作可到245。每次需要1个{item:3860}和1个{item:10505}，产出200个。先做好那50个{item:10505}。用你先前做好的那12个{item:10505}；上面的数量未计入它们。每次一个{item:3860}和一个{item:10505}；猎人们会买这种弹丸。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（225-300需118个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 245"] = "{skill:202} 245 级配方",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12621} (from 245)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12621}（245起）。",
		["{item:10513} to 265"] = "{item:10513} 到265",
		["{item:10513} is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265. Each takes 2 {item:3860} and 2 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 56 {item:10505} first. Two Mithril Bars and two {item:10505} a craft. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:10513}在245时为黄色（245黄、265绿、285灰）：大约28次制作可到265。每次需要2个{item:3860}和2个{item:10505}，产出200个。先做好那56个{item:10505}。每次两个秘银锭和两个{item:10505}。附近需要铁砧。",
		["{item:15994} to 287"] = "{item:15994} 到287",
		["{item:15994} is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287. Each takes 3 {item:12359} and 1 {item:14047}. Three Thorium Bars and a {item:14047} a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (156 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:15994}在265时为橙色（280黄、290绿、300灰）：大约24次制作可到287。每次需要3个{item:12359}和1个{item:14047}。每次三个瑟银锭和一块{item:14047}；这些零件是后续瑟银装置的组件。附近需要铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300需156个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:10620}；或在拍卖行购买。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包里的配方",
		["{item:16000} to 300"] = "将{item:16000}做到 300",
		["{item:16000} is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 {item:12359}. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. {skill:202} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:16000}在287时为橙色（295黄、305绿、315灰）：大约14次制作可到300。每次需要6个{item:12359}。图纸拾取即绑定；每次六个瑟银锭。附近需要铁砧。{skill:202} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/first-aid"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:129}"] = "学习{skill:129}",
		["Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:129} (character level 5, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever teaches {item:118} with it: {item:2447}, {item:2678} and an {item:3371}, orange to 55. With {skill:182} it can replace the Linen Bandages below."] = "你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师都教授初级{skill:129}（角色等级5，1银）；箭头会指向最近的一位。Forever会同时教授{item:118}：{item:2447}、{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}，55前为橙色。有{skill:182}的话，它可以替代下面的亚麻绷带。",
		["{item:1251}: cloth"] = "{item:1251}：布料",
		["humanoids of level 5-20 drop {item:2589} (or buy it at the Auction House)."] = "5-20级的人型生物会掉落{item:2589}（或在拍卖行购买）。",
		["{item:1251} is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, green at 45, grey at 60): about 41 crafts to 40. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. At 20 the trainer also teaches {item:279968} (1s; the Camping 101: {skill:129} quest at your starting area's camp teaches it free), Forever's camping item for {skill:129}: three Linen Bandages and a {item:159}; it gives a few points until 25."] = "{item:1251}从1开始为橙色（30变黄，45变绿，60变灰）：约制作41次到40。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。20时训练师还会教授{item:279968}（1银；起始区域营地的“野营入门：{skill:129}”任务可免费学会），这是Forever的{skill:129}野营物品：三条亚麻绷带和一瓶{item:159}；25前能提供少量点数。",
		["{item:2581}: cloth"] = "{item:2581}：布料",
		["{item:2581} is orange from 40 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 10 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 40 for 1s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:2581}从40开始为橙色（50变黄，75变绿，100变灰）：约制作10次到50。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能40时教授，花费1银；箭头会指向最近的一位。",
		["Journeyman {skill:129}"] = "中级{skill:129}",
		["Journeyman {skill:129} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:129} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中级{skill:129}将上限提高到150；需要技能50和角色等级10：箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的{skill:129}训练师；训练花费5银。",
		["{item:2581} is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Herbalists: {item:858} (from 55, 1s 50c; {item:2450}, two {item:2678} and an {item:3371}) is orange to 85."] = "{item:2581}从50开始为黄色（50变黄，75变绿，100变灰）：约制作46次到80。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。草药师：{item:858}（55起，1银50铜；{item:2450}、两份{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}）在85前为橙色。",
		["{spell:3277}: cloth"] = "{spell:3277}：布料",
		["humanoids of level 15-30 drop {item:2592} (or buy it at the Auction House)."] = "15-30级的人型生物会掉落{item:2592}（或在拍卖行购买）。",
		["{spell:3277} is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, green at 115, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 80 for 2s 50c; the arrow picks the nearest. {item:6452} ({item:1475}, from spiders) is taught at 80 too: Rogues need it for {spell:9810}, and it sells."] = "{spell:3277}从80起为黄色（80黄、115绿、150灰）：到115约需49次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师从技能80起教它，收费2银50铜；箭头会选最近的一位。{item:6452}（{item:1475}，从蜘蛛身上取得）也在80点时教：盗贼需要它来配合{spell:9810}，而且它卖得出去。",
		["{spell:3278}: cloth"] = "{spell:3278}：布料",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 115 for 10s; the arrow picks the nearest. Herbalists: {item:929} (from 110, 8s; {item:2453}, {item:2692} and a {item:3372}) is orange to 135."] = "{spell:3278}从115开始为黄色（115变黄，150变绿，185变灰）：约制作11次到125。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能115时教授，花费10银；箭头会指向最近的一位。草药师：{item:929}（110起，8银；{item:2453}、{item:2692}和一个{item:3372}）在135前为橙色。",
		["Expert {skill:129}"] = "高级{skill:129}",
		["Expert {skill:129} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16084} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and {item:8544} manuals (22s and 50s): buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高级{skill:129}将上限提高到225；需要技能125和角色等级20：这是一本书，{item:16084}（1金）；箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的卖家。购买并阅读。同一商人还出售厚丝绸和{item:8544}的手册（22银和50银）：现在两本都买下，在180和210时阅读。",
		["Buy and read {item:16084} (Expert {skill:129})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16084}（高级{skill:129}）",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{spell:3278}从125开始为黄色（115变黄，150变绿，185变灰）：约制作38次到150。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{item:6450}: cloth"] = "{item:6450}：布料",
		["humanoids of level 25-45 drop {item:4306} (or buy it at the Auction House)."] = "25-45级的人型生物会掉落{item:4306}（或在拍卖行购买）。",
		["{item:6450} is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, green at 180, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 150 for 50s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:6450}从150开始为黄色（150变黄，180变绿，210变灰）：约制作42次到180。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能150时教授，花费50银；箭头会指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:6451}: cloth"] = "{item:6451}：布料",
		["{item:6451} is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, green at 210, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:6451}从180开始为黄色（180变黄，210变绿，240变灰）：约制作42次到210。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{item:8544}: cloth"] = "{item:8544}：布料",
		["humanoids of level 35-50 drop {item:4338} (or buy it at the Auction House)."] = "35-50级的人型生物会掉落{item:4338}（或在拍卖行购买）。",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 210 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 18 crafts to 225. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8544}从210开始为黄色（210变黄，240变绿，270变灰）：约制作18次到225。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["Trauma"] = "创伤",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6624} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "专家级{skill:129}来自{quest:6624}任务。需要技能225和等级35；{zone:1455}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去塞拉摩找医生。现在就带上225-300所需的魔纹布（约74）和{item:14047}（约65）：绷带不需要火，所以你可以在教授专家级绷带的医生旁边练到300。",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6622} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to the doctor in {area:321}. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "大师级{skill:129}来自{quest:6622}任务。需要技能225和角色35级；{zone:1454}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去找{area:321}的医生。现在就带上魔纹布（约74匹）和{item:14047}（约65匹）用于225-300：绷带不需要火，所以你可以就在医生旁边做225-300，他会教大师级绷带。",
		["{quest:6624}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6624}：医生会给你急救绷带；用这些，不要用你自己的。里面躺着十五名伤兵：在他们死亡前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示生命条）。救满十五人后立即交还任务：其他人会继续死亡，死亡过多即使显示已完成也会失败。如果失败，放弃任务并重新接受。",
		["Artisan {skill:129}"] = "专家级{skill:129}",
		["{quest:6622}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie on the floor inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6622}：医生会给你急救绷带；用这些，不要用你自己的。里面地上躺着十五名伤兵：在他们死亡前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示生命条）。救满十五人后立即交还任务：其他人会继续死亡，死亡过多即使显示已完成也会失败。如果失败，放弃任务并重新接受。",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 225 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 24 crafts to 240. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:8544} turns green at 240: switch to Heavy Mageweave there, which costs less cloth than green Mageweave Bandages to 260."] = "{item:8544}从225开始为黄色（210变黄，240变绿，270变灰）：约制作24次到240。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。{item:8544}在240变绿：届时改做厚魔纹绷带，到260比做绿色的魔纹绷带更省布。",
		["{spell:10841} (skill 240) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:10841}（技能240）是大师级配方：只有{quest:6622}的医生会教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}、{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{item:8545}: cloth"] = "{item:8545}：布料",
		["{item:8545} is yellow from 240 (yellow at 240, green at 270, grey at 300): about 25 crafts to 260. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8545}从240开始为黄色（240变黄，270变绿，300变灰）：约制作25次到260。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{spell:18629} (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:18629}（技能260）是专家级配方：只有{quest:6622}的医生会教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{item:14529}: cloth"] = "{item:14529}：布料",
		["humanoids of level 45-60 drop {item:14047} (or buy it at the Auction House)."] = "45-60级的人型生物会掉落{item:14047}（或在拍卖行购买）。",
		["{item:14529} is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, green at 290, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:14529} turns green at 290, yet to 300 it takes about the same {item:14047} as switching to {item:14530} (the doctor teaches it at 290): one recipe is enough."] = "{item:14529}从260开始为黄色（260变黄，290变绿，320变灰）：约制作65次到300。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。{item:14529}在290变绿，但到300所需的{item:14047}与改做{item:14530}（医生在290时教授）差不多：一个配方就够了。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/fishing"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:356}"] = "学习{skill:356}",
		["Any {skill:356} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:356} (character level 5, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest, and every starting area has one on its lake or shore. Buy a {item:6256} (23c) from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it (you can only fish with a pole in your hands), and two or three Shiny Baubles (+25, 50c each): a lure adds its bonus to your skill for ten minutes, so fewer fish get away at the start. If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:356}, handed in to the fishing trainer it names at skill 20 for the {spell:1229745} recipe."] = "本阵营任意{skill:356}训练师都教初级{skill:356}（角色5级，1银）；箭头会指向最近的一位，每个新手地区湖畔或岸边都有一位。从杂货商或钓鱼供应商处买一根{item:6256}（23铜）并装备（必须手持鱼竿才能钓鱼），再买两三个闪亮的鱼饵（+25，每个50铜）：鱼饵会在十分钟内提高你的技能，开荒时鱼更难跑掉。如果你为了“户外活动”在新手地区的营火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供“露营入门：{skill:356}”，技能20时交给它指定的钓鱼训练师，可得{spell:1229745}配方。",
		["Fish here until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill. Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients. Fish get away here below skill 25; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在此钓到技能50，约50竿：75以下每竿都涨技能。从法术书施放{skill:356}，浮标下沉时点击它。留着鱼：它们是你最早的{skill:185}材料。技能25以下这里会跑鱼；给鱼竿装鱼饵可在十分钟内提高技能，弥补差距。",
		["Fish here until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill. Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients."] = "在此钓到技能50，约50竿：75以下每竿都涨技能。从法术书施放{skill:356}，浮标下沉时点击它。留着鱼：它们是你最早的{skill:185}材料。",
		["{area:16638} shore"] = "{area:16638}岸边",
		["Sen'jin coast"] = "森金海岸",
		["Journeyman {skill:356}"] = "中级{skill:356}",
		["Journeyman {skill:356} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10 (Forever's sniffed trainer lists ask for that level), and costs 5s. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:356} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229745}, Forever's camping item for {skill:356} (from skill 20, 1s or free from Camping 101: {skill:356}), is a {item:6291} in an {item:3371}: it gives no skill, but placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:356}把上限提高到150；需要技能50和角色10级（Forever 抓取的训练师列表中要求该等级），花费5银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:356}训练师。{spell:1229745}是 Forever 的{skill:356}露营物品（技能20起，1银，或从“露营入门：{skill:356}”免费获得），即装在{item:3371}里的{item:6291}：它不给技能，但放在营火旁能为一小时内的所有营地成员提供增益。",
		["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. {item:6530} (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a {item:6529}. The {item:6365} (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在此的鱼群和开阔水域钓鱼，直到技能125，约120竿：从75起涨点变慢（100时约两竿一点，125时约三竿一点）。鱼群（漂浮残骸、鱼群）还会给额外战利品。{item:6530}（技能50起可用，+50，每个1银）效果是{item:6529}的两倍。{item:6365}（技能10起可用，+5，9银1铜）在钓鱼供应商处限量出售：看到就买。技能75以下这里会跑鱼；给鱼竿装鱼饵可在十分钟内提高技能，弥补差距。",
		["{zone:1436} coast"] = "{zone:1436}海岸",
		["{zone:1439} coast"] = "{zone:1439}海岸",
		["{zone:1413} oasis"] = "{zone:1413}绿洲",
		["Expert {skill:356}"] = "高级{skill:356}",
		["Expert {skill:356} (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: {npc:2626} sells {item:16083} (1g) on the lowest dock of {area:35}, at the south tip of {zone:1434}, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20. At level 20 the safe way in is the boat from {area:392} in {zone:1413}, not the road through Stranglethorn. He also sells {item:6532} (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each), the lure for the rest of the way."] = "高级{skill:356}（上限225）是一本书，而非训练师等级：{npc:2626}在{zone:1434}南端{area:35}最下面的码头向双方阵营出售{item:16083}（1金）。买下并阅读；它需要技能125和角色20级。20级时安全的进入方式是乘{zone:1413}中{area:392}的船，而不是走荆棘谷的道路。他还出售{item:6532}（技能100起可用，+75，每个2银50铜），是后续升级用的鱼饵。",
		["Buy and read {item:16083} (Expert {skill:356})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16083}（高级{skill:356}）",
		["Fish the pools here until skill 225, about 500 catches: one in three raises the skill at 125, one in seven by 225, so this is the long stretch. Forever's second camping item, the {item:279965} (from skill 140), is a blueprint that drops from Gelihast in {area:2797}. Fish get away here below skill 150; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在此的鱼群钓鱼，直到技能225，约500竿：125时约三竿一点，225时约七竿一点，所以这是最漫长的一段。Forever 的第二个露营物品{item:279965}（技能140起）是图纸，由{area:2797}的格里哈斯特掉落。技能150以下这里会跑鱼；给鱼竿装鱼饵可在十分钟内提高技能，弥补差距。",
		["{zone:1437} coast"] = "{zone:1437}海岸",
		["{zone:1440} waters"] = "{zone:1440}水域",
		["{area:287} coast"] = "{area:287}海岸",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:356}（上限300）由{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}传授。{zone:1455}的钓鱼训练师会让你去找他；任务需要技能225和35级。",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:356}（上限300）由{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}传授。{zone:1454}的钓鱼训练师会让你去找他；任务需要技能225和35级。",
		["{npc:12919} fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore; swim over from the coast."] = "{npc:12919}在东海岸外一座小岛的岸边钓鱼，位于塞拉摩以南；从海岸游过去。",
		["Fish along the coast of {zone:1443} ({area:598} in the north-west, or the shore west of {area:2408}) until you catch a {item:16968}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{zone:1443}海岸（西北的{area:598}，或{area:2408}以西的岸边）钓鱼，直到钓上{item:16968}：那里约每五竿出一竿，别处不会咬钩。技能225时这里不会跑鱼。",
		["Fish along the {area:2521} in {zone:1444} (south-east of {area:2577}) until you catch a {item:16967}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. This water loses fish below skill 300: at 225 most get away, so put {item:6532} (+75) on the pole first."] = "在{zone:1444}的{area:2521}（{area:2577}东南）钓鱼，直到钓上{item:16967}：那里约每五竿出一竿，别处不会咬钩。这片水域在技能300以下会跑鱼：225时大部分会跑掉，所以先给鱼竿装上{item:6532}（+75）。",
		["Fish along {zone:1434}'s {area:301} (the west shore) until you catch a {item:16969}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{zone:1434}的{area:301}（西岸）钓鱼，直到钓上{item:16969}：那里约每五竿出一竿，别处不会咬钩。技能225时这里不会跑鱼。",
		["Fish along the {area:300} (the east shore of {zone:1435}) until you catch a {item:16970}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{area:300}（{zone:1435}东岸）钓鱼，直到钓上{item:16970}：那里约每五竿出一竿，别处不会咬钩。技能225时这里不会跑鱼。",
		["Artisan {skill:356}"] = "专家级{skill:356}",
		["Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300, about 650 catches (one in seven raises the skill at 225, one in ten by 300). Harder water levels no faster: a catch counts the same anywhere. From skill 225 this water loses no fish, so no lure is needed. The {item:6533} (+100 from skill 100, 2s 50c) and {item:6532} are for harder water and rare fish, not for skill."] = "在此沿岸的鱼群（鳗鱼、鲷鱼、残骸）中钓鱼，直到技能300，约650竿（225时约七竿涨一点，300时约十竿一点）。更高级的水域并不会更快：任何地方一竿的收益都一样。技能225起这片水域不会跑鱼，所以不需要鱼饵。{item:6533}（技能100起可用，+100，2银50铜）和{item:6532}是用于更高级水域和稀有鱼的，不是用来练技能的。",
		["{area:35} coast"] = "{area:35}海岸",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/herbalism"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:182}"] = "学习{skill:182}",
		["Any {skill:182} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:182} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Herbalism Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Turn on {spell:2383} (spellbook, General tab) so herbs show on the minimap. Forever's starting areas also have {object:656160} and {object:656161} (skill 1). The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247841} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors sell the {item:277113}, a four-slot bag for herbs (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:182}: hand it in to the herbalism trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1229705} recipe."] = "任何本阵营的{skill:182}训练师都能在任意等级教学徒级{skill:182}（10铜），每个起始区域的初级草药训练师也一样；箭头会指向最近的一位。打开{spell:2383}（法术书，通用页签），草药就会显示在小地图上。Forever的起始区域还有{object:656160}和{object:656161}（技能1起可采）。每个起始区域的第一小时任务（捣乱的啮齿动物、寒脊山谷送信、林地守护者、加尔加的{item:11584}、简单的任务、玛拉的遗愿）会以{item:247841}作为奖励：阅读它可得2点技能，最多到15。贸易品商人出售{item:277113}，一个装药草的四格包（25铜）。如果你为了《野外生存》在起始区域的篝火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供《露营入门：{skill:182}》：技能达到20后，把它交给任务指定的草药训练师，换取{spell:1229705}配方。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {object:656161} (1, orange), {object:656160} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，橙色）、{item:765}（1点，橙色）、{object:656161}（1点，橙色）、{object:656160}（1点，橙色）、{item:2449}（15点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 50。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {object:656161} (1, orange, rare), {object:656160} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，橙色）、{item:765}（1点，橙色）、{object:656161}（1点，橙色，稀有）、{object:656160}（1点，橙色）、{item:2449}（15点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 50。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，橙色）、{item:765}（1点，橙色）、{item:2449}（15点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 50。区域等级1-15。这49点大约需要60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，橙色）、{item:765}（1点，橙色）、{item:2449}（15点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 50。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60株草药。",
		["Journeyman {skill:182}"] = "中级{skill:182}",
		["Journeyman {skill:182} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229705}, Forever's camping item for {skill:182}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:182}): a {item:2447} and a {item:765} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:182}把上限提高到150；需要技能50，不限角色等级，花费5银：一到50就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:182}训练师。{spell:1229705}是Forever的{skill:182}露营物品，技能20起可学（1银，或从《露营入门：{skill:182}》免费获得）：每次用一个{item:2447}和一个{item:765}，能给技能点直到25；放在营火旁能为一小时内的所有营地成员提供增益。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 130 herbs for these 50 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，黄色）、{item:765}（1点，黄色）、{item:2449}（15点，黄色）、{item:785}（50点，橙色）、{item:2450}（70点起）、{item:3820}（85点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 100。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要130株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 140 herbs for these 50 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，黄色）、{item:765}（1点，黄色）、{item:2449}（15点，黄色）、{item:785}（50点，橙色）、{item:2450}（70点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 100。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要140株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. A quest here needs {skill:182}: Root Samples (level 16, {npc:3446}). Zone level 10-25. Expect about 110 herbs for these 50 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，黄色）、{item:765}（1点，黄色）、{item:2449}（15点，黄色）、{item:785}（50点，橙色）、{item:2450}（70点起）、{item:3820}（85点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 100。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。这里的某个任务需要{skill:182}：根茎样本（16级，{npc:3446}）。区域等级10-25。这50点大约需要110株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 140 herbs for these 50 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2447}（1点，黄色）、{item:765}（1点，黄色）、{item:2449}（15点，黄色）、{item:785}（50点，橙色）、{item:2450}（70点起）、{item:3820}（85点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 100。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要140株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2449} (15, green), {item:785} (50, green), {item:2450} (70, yellow), {item:2453} (100, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 125. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. Zone level 15-25. Expect about 60 herbs for these 25 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2449}（15点，绿色）、{item:785}（50点，绿色）、{item:2450}（70点，黄色）、{item:2453}（100点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 125。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。区域等级15-25。这25点大约需要60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:785} (50, green), {item:2450} (70, yellow), {item:2453} (100, orange), {object:1623} (from 115) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 125. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. Zone level 15-27. Expect about 40 herbs for these 25 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:785}（50点，绿色）、{item:2450}（70点，黄色）、{item:2453}（100点，橙色）、{object:1623}（115点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 125。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。区域等级15-27。这25点大约需要40株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:765} (1, green, rare), {item:2449} (15, green, rare), {item:785} (50, green), {item:2450} (70, yellow), {item:3820} (85, orange), {item:2453} (100, orange), {object:1623} (from 115) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 125. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 40 herbs for these 25 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:765}（1点，绿色，稀有）、{item:2449}（15点，绿色，稀有）、{item:785}（50点，绿色）、{item:2450}（70点，黄色）、{item:3820}（85点，橙色）、{item:2453}（100点，橙色）、{object:1623}（115点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 125。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。区域等级20-30。这25点大约需要40株草药。",
		["Expert {skill:182}"] = "高级{skill:182}",
		["Expert {skill:182} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "高级{skill:182}把上限提高到225；需要技能125，不限角色等级，花费50银：一到125就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:182}训练师。",
		["Pick every {item:3820} (85, yellow), {object:1623} (115, orange), {item:3356} (125, orange), {item:3357} (from 150) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 160. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 30-45. Expect about 70 herbs for these 35 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:3820}（85点，黄色）、{object:1623}（115点，橙色）、{item:3356}（125点，橙色）、{item:3357}（150点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 160。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。区域等级30-45。这35点大约需要70株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2450} (70, green, rare), {item:3820} (85, green), {item:2453} (100, green, rare), {object:1623} (115, yellow, rare), {item:3356} (125, yellow), {item:3357} (150, orange), {item:3818} (160, orange), {item:3821} (from 170) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 185. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 40 herbs for these 25 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2450}（70点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3820}（85点，绿色）、{item:2453}（100点，绿色，稀有）、{object:1623}（115点，黄色，稀有）、{item:3356}（125点，黄色）、{item:3357}（150点，橙色）、{item:3818}（160点，橙色）、{item:3821}（170点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 185。{item:785}和{item:2450}有时还会额外给一个{item:2452}。{item:3820}生长在岸边水下：注意呼吸。区域等级35-45。这25点大约需要40株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2453} (100, green, rare), {object:1623} (115, green, rare), {item:3356} (125, green), {item:3357} (150, yellow), {item:3818} (160, yellow), {item:3821} (170, orange), {object:2043} (185, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 200. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 20 herbs for these 15 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:2453}（100点，绿色，稀有）、{object:1623}（115点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3356}（125点，绿色）、{item:3357}（150点，黄色）、{item:3818}（160点，黄色）、{item:3821}（170点，橙色）、{object:2043}（185点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 200。区域等级35-45。这15点大约需要20株草药。",
		["Artisan {skill:182}"] = "专家级{skill:182}",
		["Artisan {skill:182} raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "大师级{skill:182}把上限提高到300；需要技能200，不限角色等级，花费5金：一到200就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:182}训练师。",
		["{item:3818} & {object:2043}: {zone:1445} (200-210) cont."] = "{item:3818}与{object:2043}：{zone:1445}（200-210）续",
		["Pick every {object:1623} (115, green, rare), {item:3356} (125, green), {item:3357} (150, green), {item:3818} (160, yellow), {item:3821} (170, yellow), {object:2043} (185, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 210. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 20 herbs for these 10 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{object:1623}（115点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3356}（125点，绿色）、{item:3357}（150点，绿色）、{item:3818}（160点，黄色）、{item:3821}（170点，黄色）、{object:2043}（185点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 210。区域等级35-45。这10点大约需要20株草药。",
		["Pick every {object:1623} (115, green, rare), {item:3357} (150, green), {item:3818} (160, green, rare), {item:3821} (170, yellow), {object:2043} (185, yellow), {item:8831} (210, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 230. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. Zone level 40-50. Expect about 30 herbs for these 20 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{object:1623}（115点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3357}（150点，绿色）、{item:3818}（160点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3821}（170点，黄色）、{object:2043}（185点，黄色）、{item:8831}（210点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 230。{item:8831}有时还会额外给一个{item:8153}。区域等级40-50。这20点大约需要30株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:3357} (150, green, rare), {item:3818} (160, green, rare), {item:3821} (170, green), {object:2043} (185, yellow, rare), {item:8831} (210, orange), {item:8838} (230, orange), {item:8845} (from 245) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 260. {item:8845} grows in caves and dark hollows: look inside as well. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. Zone level 40-50. Expect about 50 herbs for these 30 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:3357}（150点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3818}（160点，绿色，稀有）、{item:3821}（170点，绿色）、{object:2043}（185点，黄色，稀有）、{item:8831}（210点，橙色）、{item:8838}（230点，橙色）、{item:8845}（245点起），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 260。{item:8845}生长在洞穴和黑暗的凹坑里：也要进洞看看。{item:8831}有时还会额外给一个{item:8153}。区域等级40-50。这30点大约需要50株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:3821} (170, green), {object:2043} (185, green, rare), {item:8831} (210, green), {item:8838} (230, yellow), {item:8845} (245, orange), {item:13464} (260, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 285. {item:8845} grows in caves and dark hollows: look inside as well. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. Zone level 40-50. Expect about 70 herbs for these 25 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:3821}（170点，绿色）、{object:2043}（185点，绿色，稀有）、{item:8831}（210点，绿色）、{item:8838}（230点，黄色）、{item:8845}（245点，橙色）、{item:13464}（260点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 285。{item:8845}生长在洞穴和黑暗的凹坑里：也要进洞看看。{item:8831}有时还会额外给一个{item:8153}。区域等级40-50。这25点大约需要70株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:8836} (220, green), {item:8838} (230, green), {item:13463} (270, orange), {item:13465} (280, orange), {item:13466} (285, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 300. Zone level 51-58. Expect about 20 herbs for these 15 points."] = "路过时采下每一个{item:8836}（220点，绿色）、{item:8838}（230点，绿色）、{item:13463}（270点，橙色）、{item:13465}（280点，橙色）、{item:13466}（285点，橙色），并绕着路标循环，直到{skill:182} 300。区域等级51-58。这15点大约需要20株草药。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/leatherworking"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:165}"] = "学习{skill:165}",
		["Apprentice {skill:165} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:165} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Pair it with {skill:393}: {item:2318} comes from the beasts of every starting zone. {item:2320} and Salt are sold by leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. 1-75 takes about 1s 50c of recipes and 5s of vendor goods, plus 349 {item:2318} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:165}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜学会，可制作到75。本阵营任意{skill:165}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。搭配{skill:393}：{item:2318}来自每个新手地区的野兽。{item:2320}和盐由制皮和贸易补给商出售。1-75大约花1银50铜的配方钱和5银的商人货物，外加349个{item:2318}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:165} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:165} 1-75：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 50 {item:2320} (5s); about 5s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：50个{item:2320}（5银）；总共约5银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1922}, {npc:525}, Prowler, {npc:524}, {npc:113} and {npc:822} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:1922}、{npc:525}、游荡者、{npc:524}、{npc:113}和{npc:822}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1125}, {npc:1127}, {npc:1196}, {npc:1199}, {npc:1126}, {npc:1689}, {npc:1201}, {npc:1138}, {npc:1131} and {npc:1128} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:1125}、{npc:1127}、{npc:1196}、{npc:1199}、{npc:1126}、{npc:1689}、{npc:1201}、{npc:1138}、{npc:1131}和{npc:1128}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2033}, Nightsaber and {npc:2043} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2033}、夜刃豹和{npc:2043}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin Cloudrunner, Galestrider, {npc:250928}, {npc:251284}, {npc:251291}, {npc:251707}, Prideclaw, {npc:256092}, {npc:253282}, Vuldren, {npc:250874} and {npc:254588} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取云奔者、风行者、{npc:250928}、{npc:251284}、{npc:251291}、{npc:251707}、傲爪、{npc:256092}、{npc:253282}、鹫龙、{npc:250874}和{npc:254588}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:3126}, {npc:3123}, {npc:3122}, {npc:3125}, {npc:3099}, {npc:3110}, {npc:3121}, {npc:3100}, {npc:3130} and {npc:3127} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:3126}、{npc:3123}、{npc:3122}、{npc:3125}、{npc:3099}、{npc:3110}、{npc:3121}、{npc:3100}、{npc:3130}和{npc:3127}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2956}, {npc:2957}, {npc:3035}, {npc:3566}, {npc:2972}, {npc:2959}, {npc:2958} and {npc:2960} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2956}、{npc:2957}、{npc:3035}、{npc:3566}、{npc:2972}、{npc:2959}、{npc:2958}和{npc:2960}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1548}, {npc:1547}, {npc:1553}, {npc:1549} and {npc:1554} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:1548}、{npc:1547}、{npc:1553}、{npc:1549}和{npc:1554}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["{spell:2152} to 51"] = "{spell:2152}到51",
		["{spell:2152} is orange at 1 (yellow 30, green 45, grey 60): about 64 crafts to 51. Each takes 1 {item:2318}. One {item:2318} a craft; the kits sell to vendors."] = "{spell:2152}在1时为橙色（30黄、45绿、60灰）：大约64次制作可到51。每次需要1个{item:2318}。每次一个{item:2318}；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 51"] = "{skill:165} 51时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3756} (from 40, 1s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229432} (1s): Forever's {skill:165} camp item, 5 {item:2318}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. The Camping 101: {skill:165} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a leatherworking trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:3756}（40起，1银50铜）。同时学习{spell:1229432}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:165}露营物品，需5个{item:2318}，放在营火旁的营地。“露营入门：{skill:165}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的制皮训练师那里。",
		["{spell:3756} to 75"] = "{spell:3756}到75",
		["{spell:3756} is orange at 51 (yellow 70, green 85, grey 100): about 25 crafts to 75. Each takes 3 {item:2318} and 2 {item:2320}. Forever teaches {spell:3756} from 40."] = "{spell:3756}在51时为橙色（70黄、85绿、100灰）：大约25次制作可到75。每次需要3个{item:2318}和2个{item:2320}。Forever中{spell:3756}从40起可学。",
		["Journeyman {skill:165}"] = "中级{skill:165}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:165} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:165} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:3967} ({zone:1440}), {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), Faldron ({zone:1457}), {npc:5127} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5564} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horde {npc:4588} ({zone:1458}), {npc:1385} ({zone:1434}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}), {npc:3365} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3703} ({zone:1413}), {npc:8153} ({zone:1443}), Tarn ({zone:1456}) and {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3763} (from 55, 3s). 75-150 takes about 15s 50c of recipes and 57s of vendor goods, plus 144 {item:2319}, 24 {item:2457} and 308 {item:4234} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银；它需要{skill:165} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:165}训练师都教：联盟{npc:3967}（{zone:1440}）、{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）、{npc:252376}（{zone:2521}）、法尔顿（{zone:1457}）、{npc:5127}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5564}（{zone:1453}）和{npc:4212}（{zone:1457}）；部落{npc:4588}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:1385}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:252376}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）、{npc:3365}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:3703}（{zone:1413}）、{npc:8153}（{zone:1443}）、塔恩（{zone:1456}）和{npc:3007}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3763}（55起，3银）。75-150大约花15银50铜的配方钱和57银的商人货物，外加144个{item:2319}、24个{item:2457}和308个{item:4234}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:165} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:165} 75-150：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 70 {item:2320} (7s) and 50 {item:2321} (50s); about 57s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：70个{item:2320}（7银）和50个{item:2321}（50银）；总共约57银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["144 {item:2319} for {item:7285}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 18-30; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2248}, {npc:2356}, {npc:2385}, {npc:2351}, Snapjaw, {npc:2384} and {npc:2354} here (level 18-30); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "144个{item:2319}，用于{item:7285}：靠{skill:393}剥取18到30级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2248}、{npc:2356}、{npc:2385}、{npc:2351}、钳颚、{npc:2384}和{npc:2354}（18到30级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["144 {item:2319} for {item:7285}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 18-30; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:3823} and {npc:2071} here (level 18-30); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "144个{item:2319}，用于{item:7285}：靠{skill:393}剥取18到30级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:3823}和{npc:2071}（18到30级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["144 {item:2319} for {item:7285}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 18-30; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:3236} and Thunderhead here (level 18-30); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "144个{item:2319}，用于{item:7285}：靠{skill:393}剥取18到30级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:3236}和雷首（18到30级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["308 {item:4234} for {spell:3780} and {item:4304} (178 of them for 150-225: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 28-40; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2248}, {npc:2249}, {npc:2251}, {npc:2407}, {npc:2406}, {npc:2250} and Snapjaw here (level 28-40); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "308个{item:4234}，用于{spell:3780}和{item:4304}（其中178个用于150-225：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取28到40级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2248}、{npc:2249}、{npc:2251}、{npc:2407}、{npc:2406}、{npc:2250}和钳颚（28到40级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["308 {item:4234} for {spell:3780} and {item:4304} (178 of them for 150-225: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 28-40; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:4107}, {npc:4147}, {npc:4140}, {npc:4139}, {npc:4143} and {npc:4142} here (level 28-40); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "308个{item:4234}，用于{spell:3780}和{item:4304}（其中178个用于150-225：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取28到40级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:4107}、{npc:4147}、{npc:4140}、{npc:4139}、{npc:4143}和{npc:4142}（28到40级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["{spell:3763} to 102"] = "{spell:3763}到102",
		["{spell:3763} is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 100, grey 115): about 35 crafts to 102. Each takes 6 {item:2318} and 2 {item:2320}. Forever teaches {spell:3763} from 55."] = "{spell:3763}在75时为橙色（85黄、100绿、115灰）：大约35次制作可到102。每次需要6个{item:2318}和2个{item:2320}。Forever中{spell:3763}从55起可学。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 102"] = "{skill:165} 102时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:9074} (from 95, 5s)."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:9074}（95起，5银）。",
		["{item:7285} to 125"] = "{item:7285}到125",
		["{item:7285} is orange at 102 (yellow 120, green 132, grey 145): about 24 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 {item:2457}, 6 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2321}. Each takes an {item:2457}: an alchemist makes it from a {item:2452} and a {item:765}, and the Auction House has it cheap. With no elixirs, take {spell:3763} on to 105 and {item:2316} (from 85: 8 {item:2319}, a {item:4340} and a {item:2321}) to 125: about 28 cloaks, 224 {item:2319} in all. {item:2457} (24 for 75-150): {skill:171}: {item:2457}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:7285}在102时为橙色（120黄、132绿、145灰）：大约24次制作可到125。每次需要1个{item:2457}、6个{item:2319}和1个{item:2321}。每次都要一个{item:2457}：炼金师用{item:2452}和{item:765}制作，拍卖行卖得很便宜。若不用药剂，就把{spell:3763}做到105，再用{item:2316}（85起：8个{item:2319}、一个{item:4340}和一个{item:2321}）做到125：大约28件披风，共224个{item:2319}。{item:2457}（75-150需24个）：{skill:171}：{item:2457}；或去拍卖行。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 125"] = "{skill:165} 125时的配方",
		["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3780} (from 125, 7s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:3780}（125起，7银50铜）。",
		["{spell:3780} to 150"] = "{spell:3780}到150",
		["{spell:3780} is orange at 125 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 26 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 {item:4234} and 1 {item:2321}. Five {item:4234} a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors. {skill:165} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3780}在125时为橙色（145黄、155绿、165灰）：大约26次制作可到150。每次需要5个{item:4234}和1个{item:2321}。每次五个{item:4234}（28到40级的野兽）；护甲片可以卖给商人。{skill:165} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
		["{skill:165} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:165} 150-225：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 8 {item:2321} (8s) and 32 {item:4291} (1g 60s); about 1g 68s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：8个{item:2321}（8银）和32个{item:4291}（1金60银）；总共约1金68银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["{item:4304} (Alliance)"] = "{item:4304}（联盟）",
		["257 {item:4304} for {item:8173} and {item:8170}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 38-50; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2729}, {npc:2730}, {npc:2732} and {npc:2734} here (level 38-50); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "257个{item:4304}，用于{item:8173}和{item:8170}：靠{skill:393}剥取38到50级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2729}、{npc:2730}、{npc:2732}和{npc:2734}（38到50级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["{item:4304} (Horde)"] = "{item:4304}（部落）",
		["257 {item:4304} for {item:8173} and {item:8170}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 38-50; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:5292}, {npc:5300}, {npc:5304}, {npc:5272}, {npc:5260}, {npc:5262}, {npc:5268}, {npc:5274}, {npc:5287}, {npc:5286} and {npc:5296} here (level 38-50); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "257个{item:4304}，用于{item:8173}和{item:8170}：靠{skill:393}剥取38到50级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:5292}、{npc:5300}、{npc:5304}、{npc:5272}、{npc:5260}、{npc:5262}、{npc:5268}、{npc:5274}、{npc:5287}、{npc:5286}和{npc:5296}（38到50级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["Expert {skill:165}"] = "高级{skill:165}",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs {skill:165} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}) and {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}) and {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 1g 68s of vendor goods, plus 257 {item:4304} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:4304} (from 155) and {item:8173} (from 175), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3. {item:8170} (from 205) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below)."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225；它需要{skill:165} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）和{npc:4212}（{zone:1457}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）和{npc:3007}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。150-225大约花1金68银的商人货物，外加257个{item:4304}，需自行采集或购买。把材料全部带在包里再来（前几步攒下的，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师也教{item:4304}（155起）和{item:8173}（175起），而这些制作无需工作台，所以就在原地制作，技能一到就学新配方。一趟搞定，而不是三趟。{item:8170}（205起）要再跑一趟，找其他训练师（见下）。",
		["{spell:3780} to 155"] = "{spell:3780}到155",
		["{spell:3780} is yellow at 150 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 8 crafts to 155. Each takes 5 {item:4234} and 1 {item:2321}. Five {item:4234} a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3780}在150时为黄色（145黄、155绿、165灰）：大约8次制作可到155。每次需要5个{item:4234}和1个{item:2321}。每次五个{item:4234}（28到40级的野兽）；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 155"] = "{skill:165} 155时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:20650} (from 155)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:20650}（155起）。",
		["{item:4304} to 177"] = "{item:4304}到177",
		["{item:4304} is orange at 155 (yellow 175, green 177, grey 180): about 23 crafts to 177. Each takes 6 {item:4234}. Six {item:4234} make one {item:4304}, orange until 175: keep them, the Thick Armor Kits next use them."] = "{item:4304}在155时为橙色（175黄、177绿、180灰）：大约23次制作可到177。每次需要6个{item:4234}。六个{item:4234}可做一个{item:4304}，在175前都是橙色：留着它们，接下来的厚护甲片要用。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 177"] = "{skill:165} 177时的配方",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:10487} (from 175)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:10487}（175起）。",
		["{item:8173} to 205"] = "{item:8173}到205",
		["{item:8173} is orange at 177 (yellow 195, green 205, grey 215): about 32 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 {item:4304} and 1 {item:4291}. Use the 23 {item:4304} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Five {item:4304} a craft; the kits sell to vendors."] = "{item:8173}在177时为橙色（195黄、205绿、215灰）：大约32次制作可到205。每次需要5个{item:4304}和1个{item:4291}。用你早先做的23个{item:4304}；上面的计数没有算它们。每次五个{item:4304}；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
		["{skill:165} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:165} 205时的配方",
		["{spell:22331} (from 205) is taught only by the Artisan trainers: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). You can train Artisan there now if you are level 35 (it needs {skill:165} 200), which saves the trip at 225."] = "{spell:22331}（205起）只由大师级训练师教授：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）。如果你已35级（它需要{skill:165} 200），现在就可以在那里学大师级，省掉225时再跑一趟。",
		["{item:8170} to 225"] = "{item:8170}到225",
		["{item:8170} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 225, grey 225): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 6 {item:4304}. {item:8170} from {item:4304}: the points come cheap and you need the {item:8170} next. {skill:165} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:8170}在205时为橙色（225黄、225绿、225灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要6个{item:4304}。由{item:4304}制得{item:8170}：涨点很便宜，而且接下来正需要{item:8170}。{skill:165} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
		["Artisan {skill:165}"] = "专家级{skill:165}",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs {skill:165} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:19058} (from 205). 225-300 takes about 3g 40s of recipes and 44g 90s of vendor goods, plus 1009 {item:8170} and 430 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300；它需要{skill:165} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:19058}（205起）。225-300大约花3金40银的配方钱和44金90银的商人货物，外加1009个{item:8170}和430个{item:14047}，需自行采集或购买。",
		["{skill:165} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:165} 225-300：商人货物",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 39 {item:2325} (3g 90s) and 82 {item:14341} (41g); about 44g 90s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：39个{item:2325}（3金90银）和82个{item:14341}（41金）；总共约44金90银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["{item:15725} teaches {item:15083} ({skill:165} 235) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:12942} ({zone:1422}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:12943} ({zone:1422}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:15725}教你{item:15083}（{skill:165} 235），售价1金20银。联盟由{npc:12942}（{zone:1422}）出售，库存有限；部落由{npc:12943}（{zone:1422}）出售，库存有限。卖家通常只存一两件，卖掉后过一段时间才补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
		["{item:15756} teaches {item:15094} ({skill:165} 265) for 2g 20s. Sold by {npc:12941} ({zone:1423}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:15756}教你{item:15094}（{skill:165} 265），售价2金20银。由{npc:12941}（{zone:1423}）出售，库存有限。卖家通常只存一两件，卖掉后过一段时间才补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
		["{item:8170} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8170}（联盟）",
		["1009 {item:8170} for {item:15564}, {item:15083} and {item:15094}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1815}, {npc:1816} and {npc:1817} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "1009个{item:8170}，用于{item:15564}、{item:15083}和{item:15094}：靠{skill:393}剥取48到60级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:1815}、{npc:1816}和{npc:1817}（48到60级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["{item:8170} (Horde)"] = "{item:8170}（部落）",
		["1009 {item:8170} for {item:15564}, {item:15083} and {item:15094}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:6369}, {npc:8760}, {npc:6380}, {npc:6379}, {npc:6378} and {npc:6377} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "1009个{item:8170}，用于{item:15564}、{item:15083}和{item:15094}：靠{skill:393}剥取48到60级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:6369}、{npc:8760}、{npc:6380}、{npc:6379}、{npc:6378}和{npc:6377}（48到60级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
		["{item:14047} (Alliance)"] = "{item:14047}（联盟）",
		["430 {item:14047} for {item:15094}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:7027} (level 56-57) here."] = "430个{item:14047}，用于{item:15094}：45到60级的人形生物会掉落；或去拍卖行。这里由{npc:7027}（56到57级）掉落。",
		["{item:14047} (Horde)"] = "{item:14047}（部落）",
		["430 {item:14047} for {item:15094}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:11880} (level 57-59) here."] = "430个{item:14047}，用于{item:15094}：45到60级的人形生物会掉落；或去拍卖行。这里由{npc:11880}（57到59级）掉落。",
		["{item:15564} to 239"] = "{item:15564}到239",
		["{item:15564} is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 23 crafts to 239. Each takes 5 {item:8170}. Use the 20 {item:8170} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Five {item:8170} a craft. Specialisation (optional): at 225 and character level 40. Dragonscale: {npc:7866} ({zone:1447}) or {npc:7867} ({zone:1418}) wants 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 {item:8204} (patterns drop from the Wastewander bandits in {zone:1446}) and 10 {item:8165}. Elemental: {npc:7868} ({zone:1427}) or {npc:7869} ({zone:1417}) wants 2 each of {item:7077}, {item:7079}, {item:7075} and {item:7081}. Tribal (from 235): {npc:7870} ({zone:1444}) or {npc:7871} ({zone:1434}) wants a {item:8211} and Helmet, after the Wild Leather quests from {npc:7852} or {npc:7854} in {zone:1444}. On Forever the specialisation patterns need a {item:279941}. You can take only one; none is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30)."] = "{item:15564}在225时为黄色（225黄、235绿、245灰）：大约23次制作可到239。每次需要5个{item:8170}。用你早先做的20个{item:8170}；上面的计数没有算它们。每次五个{item:8170}。专精（可选）：需225和角色40级。龙鳞制皮：{npc:7866}（{zone:1447}）或{npc:7867}（{zone:1418}）要2件硬甲蝎胸甲、2个{item:8204}（图样由{zone:1446}的废土匪徒掉落）和10个{item:8165}。元素制皮：{npc:7868}（{zone:1427}）或{npc:7869}（{zone:1417}）要{item:7077}、{item:7079}、{item:7075}和{item:7081}各2个。部族制皮（235起）：{npc:7870}（{zone:1444}）或{npc:7871}（{zone:1434}）要一个{item:8211}和一件头盔，前提是先完成{zone:1444}中{npc:7852}或{npc:7854}的野性之皮任务。在Forever，专精图样需要一个{item:279941}。只能选一种；冲300不需要专精，而且测试版从未测过它们（测试只到30级）。",
		["{item:15083} to 269"] = "{item:15083}到269",
		["{item:15083} is orange at 239 (yellow 255, green 265, grey 275): about 39 crafts to 269. Each takes 8 {item:8170}, 1 {item:2325} and 1 {item:14341}. Eight {item:8170} a craft; {item:2325} and {item:14341} from leatherworking or tailoring vendors."] = "{item:15083}在239时为橙色（255黄、265绿、275灰）：大约39次制作可到269。每次需要8个{item:8170}、1个{item:2325}和1个{item:14341}。每次八个{item:8170}；{item:2325}和{item:14341}从制皮或裁缝供应商处购买。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包中的配方",
		["{item:15094} to 300"] = "{item:15094}做到300",
		["{item:15094} is orange at 269 (yellow 285, green 295, grey 305): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 14 {item:8170}, 10 {item:14047} and 1 {item:14341}. 14 {item:8170} and 10 {item:14047} a craft: the dearest stretch. {skill:165} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:15094}在269时为橙色（285黄、295绿、305灰）：大约43次制作可到300。每次需要14个{item:8170}、10个{item:14047}和1个{item:14341}。每次十四个{item:8170}和十个{item:14047}：这是最贵的一段。{skill:165} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/mining"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:186}"] = "学习{skill:186}",
		["Any {skill:186} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:186} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Mining Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:2901} from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot mine without it. Turn on {spell:2580} (spellbook, General tab) so veins show on the minimap. Forever's starting areas also have Poor Copper Veins ({item:2770} and {item:2835}, from skill 1). The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247840} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors and the junior trainers sell the {item:277115}, a four-slot bag for ore and stone (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:186}: hand it in to the mining trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1230161} recipe."] = "任何本阵营的{skill:186}训练师都能在任意等级教学徒级{skill:186}（10铜），每个起始区域的初级采矿训练师也一样；箭头会指向最近的一位。从杂货或贸易品商人处买一把{item:2901}：放在背包里，没有它就无法采矿。打开{spell:2580}（法术书，通用页签），矿脉就会显示在小地图上。Forever的起始区域还有劣质铜矿脉（{item:2770}和{item:2835}，技能1起可采）。每个起始区域的第一小时任务（捣乱的啮齿动物、寒脊山谷送信、林地守护者、加尔加的{item:11584}、简单的任务、玛拉的遗愿）会以{item:247840}作为奖励：阅读它可得2点技能，最多到15。贸易品商人和初级训练师出售{item:277115}，一个装矿石和石头的四格包（25铜）。如果你为了《野外生存》在起始区域的篝火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供《露营入门：{skill:186}》：技能达到20后，把它交给任务指定的采矿训练师，换取{spell:1230161}配方。",
		["Copper: {zone:1429} (1-50)"] = "铜矿：{zone:1429}（1-50）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, orange), Poor Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 50. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 nodes for these 49 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，橙色）、劣质铜矿（1点，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到50。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60个矿点。",
		["Copper"] = "铜矿",
		["Poor Copper"] = "劣质铜矿",
		["Copper, Poor Copper"] = "铜矿、劣质铜矿",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1426} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1426}（1-50）",
		["Copper: {zone:1439} (1-50)"] = "铜矿：{zone:1439}（1-50）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 50. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 60 nodes for these 49 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到50。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级10-20。这49点大约需要60个矿点。",
		["Copper: {zone:2521} (1-50)"] = "铜矿：{zone:2521}（1-50）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 50. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 60 nodes for these 49 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到50。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-15。这49点大约需要60个矿点。",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1411} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1411}（1-50）",
		["Copper: {zone:1412} (1-50)"] = "铜矿：{zone:1412}（1-50）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 50. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 nodes for these 49 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到50。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60个矿点。",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1420} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1420}（1-50）",
		["Poor Copper, Copper"] = "劣质铜矿、铜矿",
		["Journeyman {skill:186}"] = "中级{skill:186}",
		["Journeyman {skill:186} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction. {spell:1230161}, Forever's camping item for {skill:186}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:186}): a {item:2835} and a {item:2840} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:186}把上限提高到150；需要技能50，不限角色等级，花费5银：一到50就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。{spell:1230161}是Forever为{skill:186}提供的露营物品，从技能20起可学（1银，或完成《露营入门：{skill:186}》免费获得）：每份需要一个{item:2835}和一块{item:2840}，可涨点直到25；放在篝火旁，能给营地里所有人一个持续一小时的增益。",
		["Copper: {zone:1429} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿：{zone:1429}（50-65）续",
		["Mine every Copper (1, yellow), Poor Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）、劣质铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-10。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1426} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1426}（50-65）续",
		["Copper: {zone:1439} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿：{zone:1439}（50-65）续",
		["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级10-20。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
		["Copper: {zone:2521} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿：{zone:2521}（50-65）续",
		["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-15。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1411} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1411}（50-65）续",
		["Copper: {zone:1412} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿：{zone:1412}（50-65）续",
		["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-10。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
		["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1420} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1420}（50-65）续",
		["At 65 a {skill:186} trainer teaches {spell:2659} (2s; grey at 115) and {spell:3304} (50c; grey at 75): smelting at a forge raises {skill:186} too, so smelt what you mine."] = "技能65时，{skill:186}训练师会教{spell:2659}（2银；115后变灰）和{spell:3304}（50铜；75后变灰）：在熔炉旁熔炼也会提升{skill:186}，所以挖到的矿都熔掉。",
		["Incendicite & Tin: {zone:1437} (65-125)"] = "燃石与锡矿：{zone:1437}（65-125）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, green), Incendicite (65, orange), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70), {spell:3304} (grey at 75), {spell:2659} (grey at 115) give points too. {spell:2659} takes a {item:2840} and a {item:3576} each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 130 nodes for these 60 points. {spell:2658} (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，绿色）、燃石（65，橙色）、锡矿（65，橙色）、银矿（75起，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到125。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）、{spell:3304}（75后变灰）、{spell:2659}（115后变灰）也能涨点。{spell:2659}每次需要一块{item:2840}和一块{item:3576}：在学它之前，把熔炼出的锭留着。区域等级20-30。这60点大约需要130个矿点。{spell:2658}（2银；100前橙色，125后变灰）从75起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
		["Tin, Copper"] = "锡矿、铜矿",
		["Incendicite, Tin"] = "燃石、锡矿",
		["Tin: {zone:1440} (65-125)"] = "锡矿：{zone:1440}（65-125）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70), {spell:3304} (grey at 75), {spell:2659} (grey at 115) give points too. {spell:2659} takes a {item:2840} and a {item:3576} each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 18-30. Expect about 130 nodes for these 60 points. {spell:2658} (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，绿色）、锡矿（65，橙色）、银矿（75起，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到125。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）、{spell:3304}（75后变灰）、{spell:2659}（115后变灰）也能涨点。{spell:2659}每次需要一块{item:2840}和一块{item:3576}：在学它之前，把熔炼出的锭留着。区域等级18-30。这60点大约需要130个矿点。{spell:2658}（2银；100前橙色，125后变灰）从75起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
		["Tin, Silver"] = "锡矿、银矿",
		["Tin"] = "锡矿",
		["Copper & Tin: {zone:1413} (65-125)"] = "铜矿与锡矿：{zone:1413}（65-125）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70), {spell:3304} (grey at 75), {spell:2659} (grey at 115) give points too. {spell:2659} takes a {item:2840} and a {item:3576} each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 10-25. Expect about 280 nodes for these 60 points. {spell:2658} (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，绿色）、锡矿（65，橙色）、银矿（75起，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到125。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）、{spell:3304}（75后变灰）、{spell:2659}（115后变灰）也能涨点。{spell:2659}每次需要一块{item:2840}和一块{item:3576}：在学它之前，把熔炼出的锭留着。区域等级10-25。这60点大约需要280个矿点。{spell:2658}（2银；100前橙色，125后变灰）从75起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
		["Copper, Tin"] = "铜矿、锡矿",
		["Tin: {zone:1424} (65-125)"] = "锡矿：{zone:1424}（65-125）",
		["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70), {spell:3304} (grey at 75), {spell:2659} (grey at 115) give points too. {spell:2659} takes a {item:2840} and a {item:3576} each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 140 nodes for these 60 points. {spell:2658} (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，绿色）、锡矿（65，橙色）、银矿（75起，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到125。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）、{spell:3304}（75后变灰）、{spell:2659}（115后变灰）也能涨点。{spell:2659}每次需要一块{item:2840}和一块{item:3576}：在学它之前，把熔炼出的锭留着。区域等级20-30。这60点大约需要140个矿点。{spell:2658}（2银；100前橙色，125后变灰）从75起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
		["Expert {skill:186}"] = "高级{skill:186}",
		["Expert {skill:186} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction. Learn {spell:3307} (5s; orange to 130, grey at 140) on the same visit: smelting at a forge raises {skill:186} too, so smelt what you mine."] = "高级{skill:186}把上限提高到225；需要技能125，不限角色等级，花费50银：一到125就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。同一次拜访中学{spell:3307}（5银；130前橙色，140后变灰）：在熔炉旁熔炼也会提升{skill:186}，所以挖到的矿都熔掉。",
		["Iron: {zone:1417} (125-155)"] = "铁矿：{zone:1417}（125-155）",
		["Mine every Tin (65, green), Lesser Bloodstone (75, green), Silver (75, green, rare), Iron (125, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 155. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:3307} (orange to 130, grey at 140) gives points too. Zone level 30-40. Expect about 50 nodes for these 30 points."] = "路过每一处锡矿（65，绿色）、次级血石（75，绿色）、银矿（75，绿色，稀有）、铁矿（125，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到155。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:3307}（130前橙色，140后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级30-40。这30点大约需要50个矿点。",
		["Iron, Tin"] = "铁矿、锡矿",
		["Lesser Bloodstone, Silver"] = "次级血石、银矿",
		["Iron: {zone:1417} (155-175)"] = "铁矿：{zone:1417}（155-175）",
		["Mine every Tin (65, green), Lesser Bloodstone (75, green), Silver (75, green, rare), Iron (125, yellow), Gold (155, orange, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 175. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:3308} (orange to 170, grey at 185) gives points too. Zone level 30-40. Expect about 40 nodes for these 20 points. {spell:3308} (25s; orange to 170, grey at 185) is taught from 155: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处锡矿（65，绿色）、次级血石（75，绿色）、银矿（75，绿色，稀有）、铁矿（125，黄色）、金矿（155，橙色，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到175。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:3308}（170前橙色，185后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级30-40。这20点大约需要40个矿点。{spell:3308}（25银；170前橙色，185后变灰）从155起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
		["Lesser Bloodstone, Gold"] = "次级血石、金矿",
		["Mithril: {zone:1418} (175-200)"] = "秘银：{zone:1418}（175-200）",
		["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, orange), Mithril (175, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 200. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:3308} (orange to 170, grey at 185) gives points too. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 40 nodes for these 25 points."] = "路过每一处铁矿（125，绿色）、金矿（155，橙色）、秘银（175，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到200。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:3308}（170前橙色，185后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级35-45。这25点大约需要40个矿点。",
		["Iron, Mithril"] = "铁矿、秘银",
		["Artisan {skill:186}"] = "专家级{skill:186}",
		["Artisan {skill:186} raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction."] = "大师级{skill:186}把上限提高到300；需要技能200，不限角色等级，花费5金：一到200就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。",
		["Mithril: {zone:1418} (200-230) cont."] = "秘银：{zone:1418}（200-230）续",
		["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, yellow), Mithril (175, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 230. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 90 nodes for these 30 points."] = "路过每一处铁矿（125，绿色）、金矿（155，黄色）、秘银（175，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到230。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。区域等级35-45。这30点大约需要90个矿点。",
		["Mithril & {object:147516}: {zone:1427} (230-245)"] = "秘银与{object:147516}：{zone:1427}（230-245）",
		["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), {object:147516} (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 245. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. {item:11099} smelts only at the {object:174824} in {area:1584} (8 ore a bar). Zone level 43-50. Expect about 40 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处金矿（155，绿色）、秘银（175，绿色）、{object:147516}（230，橙色）、真银（230，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到245。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。{item:11099}只能在{area:1584}的{object:174824}熔炼（8块矿石成一块锭）。区域等级43-50。这15点大约需要40个矿点。",
		["Mithril, {object:147516}"] = "秘银、{object:147516}",
		["Small Thorium: {zone:1448} (245-275)"] = "小瑟银：{zone:1448}（245-275）",
		["Mine every Gold (155, green, rare), Mithril (175, green), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 275. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Quests here that need {skill:186}: Salve via {skill:186} (level 55, {npc:9528}; Alliance), Salve via {skill:186} (level 55, {npc:9529}; Horde). Zone level 48-55. Expect about 50 nodes for these 30 points."] = "路过每一处金矿（155，绿色，稀有）、秘银（175，绿色）、真银（230，橙色）、小瑟银（245，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到275。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。此处需要{skill:186}的任务：《以{skill:186}制膏》（55级，{npc:9528}；联盟）、《以{skill:186}制膏》（55级，{npc:9529}；部落）。区域等级48-55。这30点大约需要50个矿点。",
		["Mithril, Small Thorium"] = "秘银、小瑟银",
		["Small Thorium, Truesilver"] = "小瑟银、真银",
		["Small Thorium & Rich Thorium: {zone:1452} (275-300)"] = "小瑟银与富瑟银：{zone:1452}（275-300）",
		["Mine every Truesilver (230, yellow), Small Thorium (245, yellow), Rich Thorium (275, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 300. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Zone level 55-60. Expect about 40 nodes for these 25 points."] = "路过每一处真银（230，黄色）、小瑟银（245，黄色）、富瑟银（275，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到300。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。区域等级55-60。这25点大约需要40个矿点。",
		["Rich Thorium, Small Thorium"] = "富瑟银、小瑟银",
		["Rich Thorium, Truesilver"] = "富瑟银、真银",
		["Rich Thorium"] = "富瑟银",
		["Small Thorium, Rich Thorium"] = "小瑟银、富瑟银",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/skinning"] = (function() return {
		["Learn {skill:393}"] = "学习{skill:393}",
		["Any {skill:393} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:393} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Skinning Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:7005} from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it. The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247846} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors and the junior trainers sell the {item:277114}, a four-slot bag for leather and hides (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:393}: hand it in to the skinning trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1229517} recipe."] = "本阵营任意{skill:393}训练师都教初级{skill:393}，不限角色等级（10铜）；每个新手地区的初级剥皮训练师也一样；箭头会指向最近的一位。从材料商或杂货商处买一把{item:7005}：放在背包里，没有它就无法剥皮。每个新手地区的第一小时任务（《淘气的地鼠》、《寒脊山谷邮件投递》、《林地保护者》、加尔加的{item:11584}、《谦卑的任务》、《玛拉的遗愿》）都会把{item:247846}作为奖励：阅读它可获得2点技能，最高到15。材料商和初级训练师还出售{item:277114}，一个四格皮革与毛皮背包（25铜）。如果你为了《户外活动》在新手地区的营火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供“露营入门：{skill:393}”：技能达到20后交给它指定的剥皮训练师，可得{spell:1229517}配方。",
		["Beasts 1-9: {zone:1429} (1-50)"] = "1-9级野兽：{zone:1429}（1-50）",
		["Kill and skin {npc:1922} (7), {npc:525} (5), Prowler (9), {npc:524} (7), {npc:113} (5), {npc:69} (2), {npc:822} (8), {npc:299} (1) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. A quest here needs {skill:393}: Rough Wolf Pelts (level 7, {npc:6306}). Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1922}（7级）、{npc:525}（5级）、徘徊者（9级）、{npc:524}（7级）、{npc:113}（5级）、{npc:69}（2级）、{npc:822}（8级）、{npc:299}（1级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。这里有个任务需要{skill:393}：《粗糙的狼皮》（7级，{npc:6306}）。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
		["{npc:822}, Prowler"] = "{npc:822}、徘徊者",
