		["Kill and skin {npc:213} (19), {npc:565} (20) along the loop until {skill:393} 125; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 18-30. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:213}（19级）、{npc:565}（20级），直到{skill:393}达到125；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级18-30。这25点大约需要30只野兽。",
