		["Beasts 42-49: {zone:1425} (225-250)"] = "42-49级野兽：{zone:1425}（225-250）",
		["Kill and skin {npc:2927} (42), {npc:2924} (43), {npc:2928} (44), {npc:2929} (46, needs 230), {npc:2926} (47, needs 235), {npc:2505} (49, needs 245) along the loop until {skill:393} 250; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 40-50. Expect about 40 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:2927}（42级）、{npc:2924}（43级）、{npc:2928}（44级）、{npc:2929}（46级，需技能230）、{npc:2926}（47级，需技能235）、{npc:2505}（49级，需技能245），直到{skill:393}达到250；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级40-50。这25点大约需要40只野兽。",
		["Beasts 48-54: {zone:1449} (250-275)"] = "48-54级野兽：{zone:1449}（250-275）",
		["Kill and skin {npc:9165} (48), Ravasaur (48), {npc:6507} (49), {npc:6506} (49), {npc:9162} (49), Pterrordax (50), {npc:6514} (50), {npc:6508} (50), Diemetradon (51, needs 255), {npc:9167} (51, needs 255), {npc:6513} (51, needs 255), {npc:6516} (52, needs 260), {npc:9164} (53, needs 265), {npc:11735} (54, needs 270) along the loop until {skill:393} 275; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 48-55. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:9165}（48级）、掠食龙（48级）、{npc:6507}（49级）、{npc:6506}（49级）、{npc:9162}（49级）、翼手龙（50级）、{npc:6514}（50级）、{npc:6508}（50级）、双帆龙（51级，需技能255）、{npc:9167}（51级，需技能255）、{npc:6513}（51级，需技能255）、{npc:6516}（52级，需技能260）、{npc:9164}（53级，需技能265）、{npc:11735}（54级，需技能270），直到{skill:393}达到275；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级48-55。这25点大约需要30只野兽。",
		["Pterrordax, {npc:6514}"] = "翼手龙、{npc:6514}",
